(2399355, 331809, 47487, '<td valign="top">Um, the moon was not full at any time during this challenge. Methinks that''s the sun, and some fancy editing... or else this was taken outside the challenge dates. As far as it goes, it''s a decent-enough image, although it would be better with more contrast.</td>', 'Um, the moon was not full at any time during this challenge. Methinks that''s the sun, and some fancy editing... or else this was taken outside the challenge dates. As far as it goes, it''s a decent-enough image, although it would be better with more contrast.', '2006-05-10 02:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
