(2401302, 332353, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, but there''s nothing in the foreground to pull me in.  I probably would have framed those trees in the shot to silhouette them against the sky.</td>', 'I like the sky, but there''s nothing in the foreground to pull me in.  I probably would have framed those trees in the shot to silhouette them against the sky.', '2006-05-10 13:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401303, 331053, 58739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-05-10 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401307, 332290, 32644, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but too small.</td>', 'Nice shot but too small.', '2006-05-10 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401311, 330031, 57202, '<td valign="top">Great idea to shoot a ferris wheel. :)</td>', 'Great idea to shoot a ferris wheel. :)', '2006-05-10 13:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401317, 331858, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very interesting object. I like the design itself. Nice colours and detail. I wonder how it would''ve look if you put the end of the bridge in center of the image.</td>', 'Very interesting object. I like the design itself. Nice colours and detail. I wonder how it would''ve look if you put the end of the bridge in center of the image.', '2006-05-10 13:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401319, 330952, 57202, '<td valign="top">Wow. :)  Not only am I impressed that you know somewhere that there are so many visible stars, but you must have one hell of a lens...</td>', 'Wow. :)  Not only am I impressed that you know somewhere that there are so many visible stars, but you must have one hell of a lens...', '2006-05-10 13:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401321, 332243, 57202, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but where does the "strange" part of the title come into play?</td>', 'I like the shot, but where does the "strange" part of the title come into play?', '2006-05-10 13:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401332, 332247, 57202, '<td valign="top">I would have shot this at a smaller aperture so the sky wasn''t so day-like.  I also would have adjusted the white balance to give some cooler colors in the sky.  I''ve found that a Tungsten setting (if you have it) gives a nice blue cast to night shots.</td>', 'I would have shot this at a smaller aperture so the sky wasn''t so day-like.  I also would have adjusted the white balance to give some cooler colors in the sky.  I''ve found that a Tungsten setting (if you have it) gives a nice blue cast to night shots.', '2006-05-10 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401335, 332226, 32644, '<td valign="top">Please use a tripod.</td>', 'Please use a tripod.', '2006-05-10 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401339, 331577, 57202, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I would have liked it more if it was resized to the full 640 px width.</td>', 'Great shot, but I would have liked it more if it was resized to the full 640 px width.', '2006-05-10 13:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401341, 332256, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is very cool. It just needs to be in focus.</td>', 'This is very cool. It just needs to be in focus.', '2006-05-10 13:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401350, 330791, 32644, '<td valign="top">Whoa - very Cool!</td>', 'Whoa - very Cool!', '2006-05-10 13:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401352, 330826, 26679, '<td valign="top">The colours and lighting are beautiful. The only thing that spoils it for me is the horizon. Either more skewed or straight works for me. That being said you still have captured a great shot</td>', 'The colours and lighting are beautiful. The only thing that spoils it for me is the horizon. Either more skewed or straight works for me. That being said you still have captured a great shot', '2006-05-10 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401358, 331204, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to frame it with the branches, although the fact that it is out of focus (I know - the breeze) it disturbs me a bit. The water is just magical. I wish you focused on the water more. It''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice idea to frame it with the branches, although the fact that it is out of focus (I know - the breeze) it disturbs me a bit. The water is just magical. I wish you focused on the water more. It''s a very nice shot.', '2006-05-10 13:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401366, 330589, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice city line. I like the reflections.</td>', 'Nice city line. I like the reflections.', '2006-05-10 13:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401372, 331396, 53840, '<td valign="top">It would look very nice... but all the highlights are blown to wherever and beyond. Try to underexpose, you can always light up afterwards!</td>', 'It would look very nice... but all the highlights are blown to wherever and beyond. Try to underexpose, you can always light up afterwards!', '2006-05-10 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401375, 330739, 5746, '<td valign="top">I think you tried to cover too much. It is a beautiful building, but people, cars take away from the total atmosphere. I think you should try to reshoot it focusing on part of the building only, or... wait for the people to desapear ;) The lamp on the left is unecessary.</td>', 'I think you tried to cover too much. It is a beautiful building, but people, cars take away from the total atmosphere. I think you should try to reshoot it focusing on part of the building only, or... wait for the people to desapear ;) The lamp on the left is unecessary.', '2006-05-10 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401377, 331526, 53840, '<td valign="top">Not really original. Is there really nothing interesting outside your living room?</td>', 'Not really original. Is there really nothing interesting outside your living room?', '2006-05-10 13:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401378, 331094, 53840, '<td valign="top">No idea what CPD is, but VERY impressive shot!</td>', 'No idea what CPD is, but VERY impressive shot!', '2006-05-10 13:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401400, 331033, 32644, '<td valign="top">Cool capture! Too bad it is blurred a bit.</td>', 'Cool capture! Too bad it is blurred a bit.', '2006-05-10 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401406, 330208, 56754, '<td valign="top">Holy crap!  I would have never thought to play with my zoom during a long exposure, but what a cool freakin'' effect it has!!</td>', 'Holy crap!  I would have never thought to play with my zoom during a long exposure, but what a cool freakin'' effect it has!!', '2006-05-10 13:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
