(2401515, 332251, 19507, '<td valign="top">Pretty place and nice shot.  I think I would possibly have cropped off some of the empty space in the foreground to move the main subject a little more off center.</td>', 'Pretty place and nice shot.  I think I would possibly have cropped off some of the empty space in the foreground to move the main subject a little more off center.', '2006-05-10 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
