(2401543, 331526, 5746, '<td valign="top">If it was only a bit bigger... Nice minimalistic picture. There is something on the left of the wall (a switch?) which is distracting a bit.</td>', 'If it was only a bit bigger... Nice minimalistic picture. There is something on the left of the wall (a switch?) which is distracting a bit.', '2006-05-10 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
