(2402246, 330546, 42845, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like the gates of hell to me despite the title.  Interesting lighting and composition with the tunnel.  The fuzzy flowers are a little distracting, but I know it can''t be helped with long shutter speeds.</td>', 'It doesn''t look like the gates of hell to me despite the title.  Interesting lighting and composition with the tunnel.  The fuzzy flowers are a little distracting, but I know it can''t be helped with long shutter speeds.', '2006-05-10 16:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
