(2402404, 330306, 42845, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the halo of light around the palm trees at the top of the cliff and the texture of the clouds and of the rock.  The composition is so simple and so quiet.  It''s my favorite image of the competition.</td>', 'This is great.  I love the halo of light around the palm trees at the top of the cliff and the texture of the clouds and of the rock.  The composition is so simple and so quiet.  It''s my favorite image of the competition.', '2006-05-10 17:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2402426, 331526, 42845, '<td valign="top">It''s too small for my liking, but night lights and outlets are small so no harm done.  I love the tones, and the composition is great -- it''s simple and graphic without being a sterile studio shot.  I like that you took a chance and I think it works.  I hope this doesn''t get the voting smack down.</td>', 'It''s too small for my liking, but night lights and outlets are small so no harm done.  I love the tones, and the composition is great -- it''s simple and graphic without being a sterile studio shot.  I like that you took a chance and I think it works.  I hope this doesn''t get the voting smack down.', '2006-05-10 17:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2402442, 331858, 42845, '<td valign="top">If people criticize the blown out highlights in the middle of the walkway, for me, I don''t think it would be as great a picture without them.  They''re a great, warm counter to the blue of the sky.  Very nice.</td>', 'If people criticize the blown out highlights in the middle of the walkway, for me, I don''t think it would be as great a picture without them.  They''re a great, warm counter to the blue of the sky.  Very nice.', '2006-05-10 17:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2402450, 332397, 42845, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, colors, and composition.</td>', 'Great lighting, colors, and composition.', '2006-05-10 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2402465, 331897, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like the blur -- it adds motion -- and the slight lack of contrast.  I wish the picture were bigger but no biggie.</td>', 'I like the blur -- it adds motion -- and the slight lack of contrast.  I wish the picture were bigger but no biggie.', '2006-05-10 17:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
