(2403243, 330853, 57839, '<td valign="top">This one had potential but there''s something that detracts a bit...and I can''t quite put my finger on it.  Flat maybe?</td>', 'This one had potential but there''s something that detracts a bit...and I can''t quite put my finger on it.  Flat maybe?', '2006-05-10 19:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403391, 330669, 43565, '<td valign="top">This could have been taken at night, it could also have been taken at noon.  It''s not a bad shot, but I don''t feel it meets the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'This could have been taken at night, it could also have been taken at noon.  It''s not a bad shot, but I don''t feel it meets the spirit of the challenge.', '2006-05-10 20:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403398, 331103, 43565, '<td valign="top">This does not seem to be a night shot to me, as the sky is too blue.  Interesting silhouette though.</td>', 'This does not seem to be a night shot to me, as the sky is too blue.  Interesting silhouette though.', '2006-05-10 20:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403400, 330051, 5746, '<td valign="top">Looks like you didn''t use the tripod. The picture is out of focus and tilted. I feel silly with tripod on the street, but it seems it is the only way to get a decent night shot. Apart from that, the object is not very interesting. I''m sure you could find a lot better areas to make a shot.</td>', 'Looks like you didn''t use the tripod. The picture is out of focus and tilted. I feel silly with tripod on the street, but it seems it is the only way to get a decent night shot. Apart from that, the object is not very interesting. I''m sure you could find a lot better areas to make a shot.', '2006-05-10 20:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403412, 330032, 5746, '<td valign="top">Unfrtunately too much noise. Night shots are so difficult. Tripod will help a lot. I''m planning to buy myself one very soon :)</td>', 'Unfrtunately too much noise. Night shots are so difficult. Tripod will help a lot. I''m planning to buy myself one very soon :)', '2006-05-10 20:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403425, 332226, 5746, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. You probably didn''t use tripod which seems to be necessary for night shots. Also the cropping is too tight.</td>', 'Out of focus. You probably didn''t use tripod which seems to be necessary for night shots. Also the cropping is too tight.', '2006-05-10 20:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403428, 331879, 5746, '<td valign="top">You were lucky to get the lightning. Pity the picture is so grainy. Night shots are very difficult.</td>', 'You were lucky to get the lightning. Pity the picture is so grainy. Night shots are very difficult.', '2006-05-10 20:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403435, 332238, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very noisy. Tiliting also doesn''t help. Pity, because it would''ve been nice panorama.</td>', 'Very noisy. Tiliting also doesn''t help. Pity, because it would''ve been nice panorama.', '2006-05-10 20:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403442, 331580, 43565, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the title.</td>', 'Don''t get the title.', '2006-05-10 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403443, 331400, 5746, '<td valign="top">To me, the object is not appealing. Maybe the light flare is too much. Maybe it is the wire... But I get your point with the title. It suits the picture well. It''s a pity it''s out of focus.</td>', 'To me, the object is not appealing. Maybe the light flare is too much. Maybe it is the wire... But I get your point with the title. It suits the picture well. It''s a pity it''s out of focus.', '2006-05-10 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403451, 331922, 5746, '<td valign="top">Difficult for me to tell, what kind of subject it is, although I looked at it at least trice. Is it a kind of tent?</td>', 'Difficult for me to tell, what kind of subject it is, although I looked at it at least trice. Is it a kind of tent?', '2006-05-10 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403452, 330154, 5746, '<td valign="top">IMHO, tilting this image does not add to the composition. Lack of focus - something I fight with for ages. Maybe your camera is too slow or too weak to achieve better results, or maybe you just didn''t use tripod. I fully understand your feelig, since I have the same problem all the time. I like very dramatic sky and nice lights on the palms. The left palm is cropped close a bit, I guess.</td>', 'IMHO, tilting this image does not add to the composition. Lack of focus - something I fight with for ages. Maybe your camera is too slow or too weak to achieve better results, or maybe you just didn''t use tripod. I fully understand your feelig, since I have the same problem all the time. I like very dramatic sky and nice lights on the palms. The left palm is cropped close a bit, I guess.', '2006-05-10 20:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403466, 332331, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s very dark. The girl looks really spooky, which is fine for the graveyard. BTW you are the brave person to go into the graveyard by night.</td>', 'It''s very dark. The girl looks really spooky, which is fine for the graveyard. BTW you are the brave person to go into the graveyard by night.', '2006-05-10 20:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403467, 331951, 5746, '<td valign="top">Too much noise.I know it very well from my own experience :( Lonely beacon looks a little out of context here without a sea. Wish there was some view of the sea.</td>', 'Too much noise.I know it very well from my own experience :( Lonely beacon looks a little out of context here without a sea. Wish there was some view of the sea.', '2006-05-10 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403470, 332335, 5746, '<td valign="top">The main focal point is the pavement. More interesting angle could help. Very shaky, although maybe you wanted it this way.</td>', 'The main focal point is the pavement. More interesting angle could help. Very shaky, although maybe you wanted it this way.', '2006-05-10 20:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403494, 330051, 42845, '<td valign="top">To me, it''s not a very interesting composition and doesn''t seem to show forethought.  Exposing for both the trees and the bulb of the street lamp means the main subject of your picture is for me distractingly blown out.</td>', 'To me, it''s not a very interesting composition and doesn''t seem to show forethought.  Exposing for both the trees and the bulb of the street lamp means the main subject of your picture is for me distractingly blown out.', '2006-05-10 20:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403503, 332352, 42845, '<td valign="top">The light is offputting to me, not because it''s bad -- it''s really directional and kind of interesting -- but because it''s lighting the underside of the slide when we''re seeing instead so much of the top.  I like the eerieness of the picture and the leading line the slide creates, though.</td>', 'The light is offputting to me, not because it''s bad -- it''s really directional and kind of interesting -- but because it''s lighting the underside of the slide when we''re seeing instead so much of the top.  I like the eerieness of the picture and the leading line the slide creates, though.', '2006-05-10 20:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403510, 332448, 42845, '<td valign="top">Does water cascade from the top of the fountain down?  It''s an interesting fountain but I don''t think, for me, it translate in the picture.  Also, maybe a shallower depth of field would have thrown the distracting background more out of focus.</td>', 'Does water cascade from the top of the fountain down?  It''s an interesting fountain but I don''t think, for me, it translate in the picture.  Also, maybe a shallower depth of field would have thrown the distracting background more out of focus.', '2006-05-10 20:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403514, 331609, 5746, '<td valign="top">The picture is a bit noisy. Also I think if the tree wasn''t visible in the bottom, it would''ve have very strong minimalistic effect with nice leading lines. Pity for he noise.</td>', 'The picture is a bit noisy. Also I think if the tree wasn''t visible in the bottom, it would''ve have very strong minimalistic effect with nice leading lines. Pity for he noise.', '2006-05-10 20:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403528, 331489, 58615, '<td valign="top">IMO it would have looked better without the person in the back, I think it distracts from the flame.</td>', 'IMO it would have looked better without the person in the back, I think it distracts from the flame.', '2006-05-10 20:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403533, 332390, 18197, '<td valign="top">This may well have been taken after dark, long exposure, high ISO and all that. But it seems like a daylight photo. Doesn''t meet the spirit of the challenge in my opinion. Having said that, I like the composition. I like the movement in the sky. And I like the grain, which is unusual because I usually don''t.</td>', 'This may well have been taken after dark, long exposure, high ISO and all that. But it seems like a daylight photo. Doesn''t meet the spirit of the challenge in my opinion. Having said that, I like the composition. I like the movement in the sky. And I like the grain, which is unusual because I usually don''t.', '2006-05-10 20:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403536, 332116, 5746, '<td valign="top">Light is quite harsh in this picture, making the tree behind the lamp looking flat. Maybe different perspective could help? I have a feeling the focus is on the tree not on the main subject.</td>', 'Light is quite harsh in this picture, making the tree behind the lamp looking flat. Maybe different perspective could help? I have a feeling the focus is on the tree not on the main subject.', '2006-05-10 20:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403540, 330547, 58615, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. This picture to me is just perfect, the light reflecting off the water, the colors, the mountains, and the person in the front. 10</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. This picture to me is just perfect, the light reflecting off the water, the colors, the mountains, and the person in the front. 10', '2006-05-10 20:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403542, 331577, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, but it''s a pity you didn''t use the 640px size. It may hurt your scores.</td>', 'Beautiful sky, but it''s a pity you didn''t use the 640px size. It may hurt your scores.', '2006-05-10 20:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403546, 331396, 5746, '<td valign="top">Not too much detail. Maybe it has something to do with the resolution or maybe you didn''t use tripod. Night shots are very difficult. Centered composition was a good choice.</td>', 'Not too much detail. Maybe it has something to do with the resolution or maybe you didn''t use tripod. Night shots are very difficult. Centered composition was a good choice.', '2006-05-10 20:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403548, 330960, 58615, '<td valign="top">Nice subject! I''ve seen it before in a photo, just forgot where, it was on this site though. Very nicely done, the sky looks beautiful and so does the city in the background.</td>', 'Nice subject! I''ve seen it before in a photo, just forgot where, it was on this site though. Very nicely done, the sky looks beautiful and so does the city in the background.', '2006-05-10 20:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403554, 330384, 5746, '<td valign="top">I wish the tree was in focus. There is also some dust visible. I guess, using tripod and adding contrast to get rid of colour cast could help a lot.</td>', 'I wish the tree was in focus. There is also some dust visible. I guess, using tripod and adding contrast to get rid of colour cast could help a lot.', '2006-05-10 20:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403559, 330327, 5746, '<td valign="top">I can see the point in the title. Is it your lens or the glass you were shooting through? It doesn''t help the image I''m afraid :(</td>', 'I can see the point in the title. Is it your lens or the glass you were shooting through? It doesn''t help the image I''m afraid :(', '2006-05-10 20:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403568, 332290, 18197, '<td valign="top">Worthy photo. I would have given it a couple more points if it were bigger and I could see more detail.</td>', 'Worthy photo. I would have given it a couple more points if it were bigger and I could see more detail.', '2006-05-10 20:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403572, 330000, 58769, '<td valign="top">THE BEST PICTURE EVER</td>', 'THE BEST PICTURE EVER', '2006-05-10 20:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403573, 331471, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very grainy. Also there is some dust visible. In night shots you have to be extremly careful with the dust, because it comes out easily. Very nice surrounding. I would advice to crop the tree tighter, to make it more like a frame, not one of the elements of the composition.</td>', 'Very grainy. Also there is some dust visible. In night shots you have to be extremly careful with the dust, because it comes out easily. Very nice surrounding. I would advice to crop the tree tighter, to make it more like a frame, not one of the elements of the composition.', '2006-05-10 20:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403577, 332007, 58615, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections. Well done.', '2006-05-10 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403585, 332014, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting. I learned here, that flash in the night shots is very rarely useful. Because of the flash, the upper part of the lentern is invisible as well, as the background, so the picture lacks some context. If you didn''t want any background, maybe a tighter crop could help.</td>', 'Very harsh lighting. I learned here, that flash in the night shots is very rarely useful. Because of the flash, the upper part of the lentern is invisible as well, as the background, so the picture lacks some context. If you didn''t want any background, maybe a tighter crop could help.', '2006-05-10 20:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403588, 330669, 42845, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, but the picture leaves me wanting more interms of composition and sharpness.  I don''t know, maybe a roomier crop would have me singing a different tune.</td>', 'Good exposure, but the picture leaves me wanting more interms of composition and sharpness.  I don''t know, maybe a roomier crop would have me singing a different tune.', '2006-05-10 20:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403591, 330138, 5746, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately in this composition, the main focal point is the gate. The "lonely place" is somwhere in both ends of the picture. Wider or different angle could definately add to the mood.</td>', 'Unfortunately in this composition, the main focal point is the gate. The "lonely place" is somwhere in both ends of the picture. Wider or different angle could definately add to the mood.', '2006-05-10 20:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403595, 331370, 5746, '<td valign="top">The image is very soft and a bit noisy. Did you use tripod? I like the red sky and the unrealistic colours.</td>', 'The image is very soft and a bit noisy. Did you use tripod? I like the red sky and the unrealistic colours.', '2006-05-10 20:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403598, 332007, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is too busy for me.</td>', 'This is too busy for me.', '2006-05-10 20:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403604, 332007, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. I like it. I think I would like it better if the white hulls were really white. As is, they look a bit flat. I believe you could adjust this via curves in PS. But maybe that would blow out the lights. Who knows?</td>', 'Interesting scene. I like it. I think I would like it better if the white hulls were really white. As is, they look a bit flat. I believe you could adjust this via curves in PS. But maybe that would blow out the lights. Who knows?', '2006-05-10 21:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403605, 332495, 42845, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty funny, and funny goes a long way.  Nice expression, and I don''t mind the flash or the resulting shadow as they''re in keeping with the kind of "bigfoot tabloid capture" feeling the picture seems to have.</td>', 'That''s pretty funny, and funny goes a long way.  Nice expression, and I don''t mind the flash or the resulting shadow as they''re in keeping with the kind of "bigfoot tabloid capture" feeling the picture seems to have.', '2006-05-10 21:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403609, 332352, 5746, '<td valign="top">The slide ends so suddenly. I would suggest either to show it in the whole glory, or to use unusual angle to make it look more like an abstract. The colours are nice, the focus is not bad. Just the whole composition is a bit unplanned. Although for the decent quality, I''m bumping it a bit higher.</td>', 'The slide ends so suddenly. I would suggest either to show it in the whole glory, or to use unusual angle to make it look more like an abstract. The colours are nice, the focus is not bad. Just the whole composition is a bit unplanned. Although for the decent quality, I''m bumping it a bit higher.', '2006-05-10 21:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403613, 331899, 18197, '<td valign="top">Possibly the best image I''ve seen so far. I would give it an extra point if you had rotated the horizon level and the buildings verticle.</td>', 'Possibly the best image I''ve seen so far. I would give it an extra point if you had rotated the horizon level and the buildings verticle.', '2006-05-10 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403627, 332471, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice selection of subject. Well composed. Well lit. Well exposed. Well focused. Unfortunately tipped to the left which distracts.</td>', 'Nice selection of subject. Well composed. Well lit. Well exposed. Well focused. Unfortunately tipped to the left which distracts.', '2006-05-10 21:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403637, 332230, 5746, '<td valign="top">The picture is very noisy and there is no single focal point. The big black negative space doesn''t help here either. There are many interesting objects in the picture, I wish you concentrated more on one of them. It could help a lot.</td>', 'The picture is very noisy and there is no single focal point. The big black negative space doesn''t help here either. There are many interesting objects in the picture, I wish you concentrated more on one of them. It could help a lot.', '2006-05-10 21:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403638, 331625, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this VERY much as pop art. Not as much as a photograph. Just my personal taste. Don''t let it worry you.</td>', 'I like this VERY much as pop art. Not as much as a photograph. Just my personal taste. Don''t let it worry you.', '2006-05-10 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403639, 330791, 51538, '<td valign="top">What a beauty.  Lovely texture too.  Unique.</td>', 'What a beauty.  Lovely texture too.  Unique.', '2006-05-10 21:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403640, 331952, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.</td>', 'Simple but effective.', '2006-05-10 21:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403641, 332114, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting romantic drama in the still night.  I like the tones.</td>', 'Interesting romantic drama in the still night.  I like the tones.', '2006-05-10 21:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403647, 330306, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal concept of the title and the image goes well with it.</td>', 'I like the surreal concept of the title and the image goes well with it.', '2006-05-10 21:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403648, 330351, 49773, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture, I like how you manage to shot the lights so well.</td>', 'Really nice capture, I like how you manage to shot the lights so well.', '2006-05-10 21:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403650, 331093, 18197, '<td valign="top">Maybe my imagination but it feels tilted to the left. Distracts a bit from a wonderful subject, well photographed and presented.</td>', 'Maybe my imagination but it feels tilted to the left. Distracts a bit from a wonderful subject, well photographed and presented.', '2006-05-10 21:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403653, 332222, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Lovely sky.  You did well to accomodate all dynamic range.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Lovely sky.  You did well to accomodate all dynamic range.', '2006-05-10 21:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403655, 331990, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp.  An eye-catching piece of architecture.</td>', 'Nice and sharp.  An eye-catching piece of architecture.', '2006-05-10 21:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403656, 332242, 5746, '<td valign="top">The sky is too bright for the title - it may hurt your scores. Also the composition is a bit unplanned. If you didn''t crop the umbrella so heavily, and use different lighting (is it flash?), the picture would''ve probably scored much higher. Now it looks a bit flat and noisy :(</td>', 'The sky is too bright for the title - it may hurt your scores. Also the composition is a bit unplanned. If you didn''t crop the umbrella so heavily, and use different lighting (is it flash?), the picture would''ve probably scored much higher. Now it looks a bit flat and noisy :(', '2006-05-10 21:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403658, 330547, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Possibly best in show from my perspective. You have done a beautiful job capturing the serenity of the moment.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Possibly best in show from my perspective. You have done a beautiful job capturing the serenity of the moment.', '2006-05-10 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403660, 331788, 5746, '<td valign="top">Looks like very interesting abstract picture but I have a feeling it is by acccident. Also the picture is very grainy. Mainly due to the abstract feeling I bump it up with 1 point.</td>', 'Looks like very interesting abstract picture but I have a feeling it is by acccident. Also the picture is very grainy. Mainly due to the abstract feeling I bump it up with 1 point.', '2006-05-10 21:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403662, 330904, 51538, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrasts and shades.  Great work.</td>', 'Wonderful contrasts and shades.  Great work.', '2006-05-10 21:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403663, 330023, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic location - good capture.</td>', 'Nice dramatic location - good capture.', '2006-05-10 21:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403668, 331143, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry.  Good idea.</td>', 'Interesting geometry.  Good idea.', '2006-05-10 21:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403671, 331746, 5746, '<td valign="top">Too noisy :( A bit more of contrast could definately help. It is a nice object, however. I would also suggest different angle.</td>', 'Too noisy :( A bit more of contrast could definately help. It is a nice object, however. I would also suggest different angle.', '2006-05-10 21:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403672, 331580, 18197, '<td valign="top">What''s up with the title.</td>', 'What''s up with the title.', '2006-05-10 21:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
