(2403697, 332219, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.  A bridge sometimes looks better from below.  It''s not often one gets the from above view point.</td>', 'Pretty good.  A bridge sometimes looks better from below.  It''s not often one gets the from above view point.', '2006-05-10 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
