(2403704, 331126, 51538, '<td valign="top">The moon is a little bright to me.  But it is difficult to accomodate everything, right.  Nice work.</td>', 'The moon is a little bright to me.  But it is difficult to accomodate everything, right.  Nice work.', '2006-05-10 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
