(2403794, 331486, 43031, '<td valign="top">aaah, too bad for you, I''m sure this is beautiful at a real size. a 4:1 pano just can''t get enough detail at 640 to be effective at all. <br/> <br/>would love to see the full size or like a 1280 wide. 10 just because I feel for ya.</td>', 'aaah, too bad for you, I''m sure this is beautiful at a real size. a 4:1 pano just can''t get enough detail at 640 to be effective at all.  would love to see the full size or like a 1280 wide. 10 just because I feel for ya.', '2006-05-10 21:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403796, 332126, 43031, '<td valign="top">nice muted tones. love the way the light is falling.</td>', 'nice muted tones. love the way the light is falling.', '2006-05-10 21:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403862, 332163, 5885, '<td valign="top">Just awesome !</td>', 'Just awesome !', '2006-05-10 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403889, 330963, 42845, '<td valign="top">The cropping seems awkward to me.  It cuts off the bottom of the river and interrupts its flow, so to speak.  Also, maybe you could''ve eliminated the concrete in the foreground.  I don''t think it''s very attractive.  But the bridge is nice, and water over long exposures always is, too.</td>', 'The cropping seems awkward to me.  It cuts off the bottom of the river and interrupts its flow, so to speak.  Also, maybe you could''ve eliminated the concrete in the foreground.  I don''t think it''s very attractive.  But the bridge is nice, and water over long exposures always is, too.', '2006-05-10 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403899, 332453, 42845, '<td valign="top">It looks like it was over sharpened to compensate for a bit of camera shake that couldn''t quite be gotten rid of nonetheless.  Or maybe you used a noise reduction program?  Nice centering of the building between the both the lamp posts and the trees.  The trees in particular act nicely as a frame.</td>', 'It looks like it was over sharpened to compensate for a bit of camera shake that couldn''t quite be gotten rid of nonetheless.  Or maybe you used a noise reduction program?  Nice centering of the building between the both the lamp posts and the trees.  The trees in particular act nicely as a frame.', '2006-05-10 22:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403906, 331471, 42845, '<td valign="top">For me, the brightness on the left is distracts from an otherwise nice, softly lit composition.  The noise and blurriness are issues, though.</td>', 'For me, the brightness on the left is distracts from an otherwise nice, softly lit composition.  The noise and blurriness are issues, though.', '2006-05-10 22:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403928, 332014, 42845, '<td valign="top">It''s not very interesting to me.  I don''t mind the cropping, in that the lamp post butts the top of the image, but I think showing more of the pole of the street sign would have emphasized the vertical lines and would have made the sign a divider between the two black halves of the picture, which for me would have added greater interest.</td>', 'It''s not very interesting to me.  I don''t mind the cropping, in that the lamp post butts the top of the image, but I think showing more of the pole of the street sign would have emphasized the vertical lines and would have made the sign a divider between the two black halves of the picture, which for me would have added greater interest.', '2006-05-10 22:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403930, 331400, 42845, '<td valign="top">The starburst is nice, but there''s not much to the composition; and what else there is to the composition, like the pole itself, is not so nice, as I see it.  But who knows?  Under different editing rules, who knows?</td>', 'The starburst is nice, but there''s not much to the composition; and what else there is to the composition, like the pole itself, is not so nice, as I see it.  But who knows?  Under different editing rules, who knows?', '2006-05-10 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403931, 332335, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but I think the picutre needs some hint of the cars other than just the trails of light the headlights have left.  I mean, without the title it''d be hard to know where you were going with the picture; and even with the title, because there is no trace of the cars themselves, you sort of have to go on faith.</td>', 'I like the concept, but I think the picutre needs some hint of the cars other than just the trails of light the headlights have left.  I mean, without the title it''d be hard to know where you were going with the picture; and even with the title, because there is no trace of the cars themselves, you sort of have to go on faith.', '2006-05-10 22:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403936, 332150, 10818, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  It may not be a strike, but I think its a spare.  Well composed, great colors and focus.  Very ncie.</td>', 'Cool shot.  It may not be a strike, but I think its a spare.  Well composed, great colors and focus.  Very ncie.', '2006-05-10 22:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403938, 332318, 42845, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the foreground is so much out of focus for this picture, the back half of the photograph is nice.  The color temperature is interesting, as is the rough texture of the rocks against the soft billows of water.</td>', 'I don''t like that the foreground is so much out of focus for this picture, the back half of the photograph is nice.  The color temperature is interesting, as is the rough texture of the rocks against the soft billows of water.', '2006-05-10 22:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403944, 332331, 58438, '<td valign="top">-8- Would have bid higher if I could make out the scene in the back.</td>', '-8- Would have bid higher if I could make out the scene in the back.', '2006-05-10 22:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403950, 332442, 58438, '<td valign="top">Would have liked it better without the person. 7</td>', 'Would have liked it better without the person. 7', '2006-05-10 22:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403964, 331625, 56243, '<td valign="top">Good Shot!</td>', 'Good Shot!', '2006-05-10 22:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403968, 330791, 56243, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if it''s at night or on a black backdrop so I give it a 6 for a good clear image.</td>', 'Can''t tell if it''s at night or on a black backdrop so I give it a 6 for a good clear image.', '2006-05-10 22:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403978, 332209, 47176, '<td valign="top">Paris, the city where we honeymooned!  I have to score this picture very high and you did a great job on the shot!  10!</td>', 'Paris, the city where we honeymooned!  I have to score this picture very high and you did a great job on the shot!  10!', '2006-05-10 22:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403980, 331925, 37893, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image. In a way, I wish I could see more of the reflection of the water than the skies. But great shot nonetheless (8)</td>', 'Fantastic image. In a way, I wish I could see more of the reflection of the water than the skies. But great shot nonetheless (8)', '2006-05-10 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403985, 331899, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great night shot of the a beautiful City. Love the fact that I can identify the skyscrapers in the background ;) Lovely colors.</td>', 'Great night shot of the a beautiful City. Love the fact that I can identify the skyscrapers in the background ;) Lovely colors.', '2006-05-10 22:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403986, 331625, 37879, '<td valign="top">Great style!  Definitely a powerful image...I can see it on a huge advertisement for teen clothes.</td>', 'Great style!  Definitely a powerful image...I can see it on a huge advertisement for teen clothes.', '2006-05-10 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403995, 331093, 37893, '<td valign="top">Lovely architectural shot! The symmetry is near perfect. I wonder if a portrait orientation would have been better so more sky is seen. (10)</td>', 'Lovely architectural shot! The symmetry is near perfect. I wonder if a portrait orientation would have been better so more sky is seen. (10)', '2006-05-10 22:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2403998, 331675, 37879, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell what''s going on.  My eyes wander from the light in the sky, the the bright lights in the middle, to the lit foreground.  No major focal point to rest on.  Nice blues in the sky, though.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell what''s going on.  My eyes wander from the light in the sky, the the bright lights in the middle, to the lit foreground.  No major focal point to rest on.  Nice blues in the sky, though.', '2006-05-10 22:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404001, 331410, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great moon shot! One of the best ones I''ve seen in a long time!</td>', 'Great moon shot! One of the best ones I''ve seen in a long time!', '2006-05-10 22:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404002, 331093, 47176, '<td valign="top">I smell a kiwi, but I could be wrong.  Great picture</td>', 'I smell a kiwi, but I could be wrong.  Great picture', '2006-05-10 22:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404005, 332222, 37879, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I''m sure someone''s brought up the hotspot at the bottom.  A little burning in advanced editing would help.  Good job overall.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I''m sure someone''s brought up the hotspot at the bottom.  A little burning in advanced editing would help.  Good job overall.', '2006-05-10 22:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404008, 331812, 37879, '<td valign="top">Very cool...very unique.  Reminds me of Roswell.</td>', 'Very cool...very unique.  Reminds me of Roswell.', '2006-05-10 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404013, 329958, 56243, '<td valign="top">Blurry but great effort.  I don''t have the proper lens to try it yet.  Keep working on it.5</td>', 'Blurry but great effort.  I don''t have the proper lens to try it yet.  Keep working on it.5', '2006-05-10 22:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404015, 331381, 37879, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough detail in the shadows to really grasp what''s going on.  I think it may be a chiminea, but a tad more brightness would help a lot.</td>', 'Not quite enough detail in the shadows to really grasp what''s going on.  I think it may be a chiminea, but a tad more brightness would help a lot.', '2006-05-10 22:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404016, 331577, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful but unfortunately way too small.</td>', 'This is beautiful but unfortunately way too small.', '2006-05-10 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404018, 330542, 37879, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2006-05-10 22:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404020, 331612, 37893, '<td valign="top">This one meets the challenge but suffers from lack of interest. THe image is too dark and there really isn''t anything for me to focus on ;(</td>', 'This one meets the challenge but suffers from lack of interest. THe image is too dark and there really isn''t anything for me to focus on ;(', '2006-05-10 22:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404030, 332115, 37879, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite strike me as interesting.  The lights run right through the middle of the composition...perhaps if you did something more extreme like drag the houses to the bottom and show a lot more sky, it could make more impact.  Though the reflections in the water are pretty cool, too.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite strike me as interesting.  The lights run right through the middle of the composition...perhaps if you did something more extreme like drag the houses to the bottom and show a lot more sky, it could make more impact.  Though the reflections in the water are pretty cool, too.', '2006-05-10 22:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404034, 332469, 37879, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like this in sepia.  I actually think this one would look great with more noise.</td>', 'Nice.  I like this in sepia.  I actually think this one would look great with more noise.', '2006-05-10 22:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404037, 332163, 37879, '<td valign="top">Looks ominous.  Not crazy about the border.</td>', 'Looks ominous.  Not crazy about the border.', '2006-05-10 22:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404041, 331823, 37879, '<td valign="top">Cool shape of the building.  Composition seems a bit off.</td>', 'Cool shape of the building.  Composition seems a bit off.', '2006-05-10 22:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404043, 331873, 37879, '<td valign="top">Nice blurring of the steam.  I think a tighter crop would be nice to get rid of the distracting yellow thing on the left hand side.  Also, the glare from the lights are a bit extreme and fighting for attention with the cooling tower.</td>', 'Nice blurring of the steam.  I think a tighter crop would be nice to get rid of the distracting yellow thing on the left hand side.  Also, the glare from the lights are a bit extreme and fighting for attention with the cooling tower.', '2006-05-10 22:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404044, 330826, 37879, '<td valign="top">beautiful blue tones.</td>', 'beautiful blue tones.', '2006-05-10 22:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404048, 332293, 37879, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect.  Reminds me of Aurora Borealis.  Building doesn''t look quite crisp enough.  Did you use a remote trigger and tripod?</td>', 'Nice lighting effect.  Reminds me of Aurora Borealis.  Building doesn''t look quite crisp enough.  Did you use a remote trigger and tripod?', '2006-05-10 22:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404049, 330289, 37879, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors.  I love this as an abstract image.</td>', 'Pretty colors.  I love this as an abstract image.', '2006-05-10 22:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404051, 331041, 37879, '<td valign="top">Cool building.  I don''t quite understand what the purpose of the person is.</td>', 'Cool building.  I don''t quite understand what the purpose of the person is.', '2006-05-10 22:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404054, 331869, 37879, '<td valign="top">Nice.  My eye does get distracted by the brightness on the right, but nothing a bit of PS burning wouldn''t fix.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice.  My eye does get distracted by the brightness on the right, but nothing a bit of PS burning wouldn''t fix.  Good job.', '2006-05-10 22:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404056, 332377, 37879, '<td valign="top">Cool sign, though the round thing in the background is a bit distracting.  I keep trying to figure out what it is.</td>', 'Cool sign, though the round thing in the background is a bit distracting.  I keep trying to figure out what it is.', '2006-05-10 22:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404060, 332476, 37879, '<td valign="top">Sooks a bit soft.  Neither the moon nore the leaves appear to be in focus.</td>', 'Sooks a bit soft.  Neither the moon nore the leaves appear to be in focus.', '2006-05-10 22:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404065, 332307, 37879, '<td valign="top">Is this Arnit?  The green sweater is nice with the blue in the sky.  A couple things to clean up at the bottom, but with no advanced editing, what can you do?  And I guess I don''t actually see the water, though that may be due to a poorly calibrated monitor.</td>', 'Is this Arnit?  The green sweater is nice with the blue in the sky.  A couple things to clean up at the bottom, but with no advanced editing, what can you do?  And I guess I don''t actually see the water, though that may be due to a poorly calibrated monitor.', '2006-05-10 22:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404071, 331952, 37879, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Love the stars swirling above.  A bit oversharpened for my taste.  I''d love to see the original version.</td>', 'Great colors!  Love the stars swirling above.  A bit oversharpened for my taste.  I''d love to see the original version.', '2006-05-10 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404075, 331723, 37879, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been an awesome photograph if taken a bit earlier in the evening.  Right around dusk the sun is down, but there''s still some nice blue hues left in the sky.  With the blak sky it''s a bit too contrasty for my taste.</td>', 'I think this could have been an awesome photograph if taken a bit earlier in the evening.  Right around dusk the sun is down, but there''s still some nice blue hues left in the sky.  With the blak sky it''s a bit too contrasty for my taste.', '2006-05-10 22:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404079, 330904, 37879, '<td valign="top">Nice.  This would look really cool as a Polaroid transfer.</td>', 'Nice.  This would look really cool as a Polaroid transfer.', '2006-05-10 22:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404086, 331899, 51385, '<td valign="top">Beatiful...a true 10.  Good luck.</td>', 'Beatiful...a true 10.  Good luck.', '2006-05-10 22:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404093, 330298, 37879, '<td valign="top">gorgeous...I like the square crop</td>', 'gorgeous...I like the square crop', '2006-05-10 23:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404098, 332390, 37879, '<td valign="top">beautiful...this would also be great in a complimentary colors challenge</td>', 'beautiful...this would also be great in a complimentary colors challenge', '2006-05-10 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404116, 332295, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a stunning shot!  Those rich rust colors!!  Congratulations</td>', 'What a stunning shot!  Those rich rust colors!!  Congratulations', '2006-05-10 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404122, 331204, 24454, '<td valign="top">How PRETTY!!!   The light on that pier and on the waves hitting the beach are what make this shot I think.   It really is beautiful!  I like the motion of the trees blowing in the breeze too!  Good luck with this!!!   I''d love to see it do really well!</td>', 'How PRETTY!!!   The light on that pier and on the waves hitting the beach are what make this shot I think.   It really is beautiful!  I like the motion of the trees blowing in the breeze too!  Good luck with this!!!   I''d love to see it do really well!', '2006-05-10 23:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404135, 330785, 18197, '<td valign="top">This was a worthy initial capture. Well imagined. Well captured. Well exposed. But IMO the post processing is so severe that it diminishes the image. There are also some lens artifacts which manifest themselves as a tilted horizon which distracts me.</td>', 'This was a worthy initial capture. Well imagined. Well captured. Well exposed. But IMO the post processing is so severe that it diminishes the image. There are also some lens artifacts which manifest themselves as a tilted horizon which distracts me.', '2006-05-10 23:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404147, 331926, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like your capture of reflections.</td>', 'I like your capture of reflections.', '2006-05-10 23:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404152, 332318, 18197, '<td valign="top">You may have intended the ultrasoft focus, but it gives my eye no place to rest. For me, that diminishes the image.</td>', 'You may have intended the ultrasoft focus, but it gives my eye no place to rest. For me, that diminishes the image.', '2006-05-10 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2404218, 331098, 24659, '<td valign="top">Cool sci-fi feel.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool sci-fi feel.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-10 23:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
