(2405243, 330438, 36328, '<td valign="top">I like that you got movement in the clouds, however IMHO I reckon the contrast of night sky and cloud needs to be better. Also, the longer expouser does nothing for the city lights. (4)</td>', 'I like that you got movement in the clouds, however IMHO I reckon the contrast of night sky and cloud needs to be better. Also, the longer expouser does nothing for the city lights. (4)', '2006-05-11 08:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
