(2405371, 332009, 5746, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the close relation to DaVinci Code, although it is a very interesting idea and nice composition. I wish there was more detail. I bumped it a bit for the artistic feel.</td>', 'I can''t see the close relation to DaVinci Code, although it is a very interesting idea and nice composition. I wish there was more detail. I bumped it a bit for the artistic feel.', '2006-05-11 09:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405377, 332390, 5746, '<td valign="top">Hard to say it is a nigh shot, but I believe the effect came out like that in postprocessing. Nice composition. The sky is a bit grainy. I wonder how did it look originaly. Bumping up a bit.</td>', 'Hard to say it is a nigh shot, but I believe the effect came out like that in postprocessing. Nice composition. The sky is a bit grainy. I wonder how did it look originaly. Bumping up a bit.', '2006-05-11 09:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405379, 332493, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place and very good composition. IMHO a little bit too soft.</td>', 'Beautiful place and very good composition. IMHO a little bit too soft.', '2006-05-11 10:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405380, 332484, 5746, '<td valign="top">I guess you didn''t want to get rid of the moon. Although the negative space does not work here I believe. IMHO, if you cropped it just above the bridge - it would''ve help. You could also use different angle. Bumping it a bit for the general idea.</td>', 'I guess you didn''t want to get rid of the moon. Although the negative space does not work here I believe. IMHO, if you cropped it just above the bridge - it would''ve help. You could also use different angle. Bumping it a bit for the general idea.', '2006-05-11 10:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405381, 331869, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonage! &lt;---is that a word?  I really like the feel, and the color coordination to the mood.  I could certainly see it on my wall. GL</td>', 'Very nice tonage! <---is that a word?  I really like the feel, and the color coordination to the mood.  I could certainly see it on my wall. GL', '2006-05-11 10:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
