(2405384, 331926, 24073, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and I like the reflections off the water.  The mood, and the set-up look decent.  I just dont think it is as crisp, and clean as it could of been.</td>', 'Nice colors, and I like the reflections off the water.  The mood, and the set-up look decent.  I just dont think it is as crisp, and clean as it could of been.', '2006-05-11 10:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405388, 330420, 24073, '<td valign="top">Just not enough, I walk away feeling like I missed something.  Very Dark.  I am just wondering if your P.C. is calibrated the same as mine.</td>', 'Just not enough, I walk away feeling like I missed something.  Very Dark.  I am just wondering if your P.C. is calibrated the same as mine.', '2006-05-11 10:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405395, 332210, 5746, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is too much brightness and not enough contrast. I like the teerace effect, bout it could be a bit more sharp.</td>', 'Looks like there is too much brightness and not enough contrast. I like the teerace effect, bout it could be a bit more sharp.', '2006-05-11 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405402, 331578, 5746, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo. One can smell the rain. Very good quality. I''m just not sure it is night :) Bumping up a bit after second pass.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo. One can smell the rain. Very good quality. I''m just not sure it is night :) Bumping up a bit after second pass.', '2006-05-11 10:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405404, 332484, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very nice, what is the light,the moon, a star?  At any rate, I love the shot.</td>', 'Very nice, what is the light,the moon, a star?  At any rate, I love the shot.', '2006-05-11 10:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405406, 332296, 5746, '<td valign="top">The effect in the water is absolutely great. After second thought I''m bumping it up significantly for the idea, composition and overall effect.</td>', 'The effect in the water is absolutely great. After second thought I''m bumping it up significantly for the idea, composition and overall effect.', '2006-05-11 10:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405412, 330960, 24073, '<td valign="top">What is it that gets your shot so fine, and clean?  It is beautiful, nice work.</td>', 'What is it that gets your shot so fine, and clean?  It is beautiful, nice work.', '2006-05-11 10:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
