(2405439, 330948, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and clean.  Good colors, good composition.  Its going to be hard to vote this anything less than 7.  Having said that I like it more than a 7.  GL :)</td>', 'Very nice, and clean.  Good colors, good composition.  Its going to be hard to vote this anything less than 7.  Having said that I like it more than a 7.  GL :)', '2006-05-11 10:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
