(2405476, 330190, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very unique, and great vision.  For those two things alone, I am voting a 6, but I also think it is good technically, and the composition is solid.  GL. :)</td>', 'Very unique, and great vision.  For those two things alone, I am voting a 6, but I also think it is good technically, and the composition is solid.  GL. :)', '2006-05-11 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
