(2405558, 330546, 5746, '<td valign="top">Night pictures, are so difficult, when it comes to technical issues. Very nice composition, lovely colours and use of light. I like the title also. I wish there was more focus on the flowers (berries) on the right and I would''ve cropped it a bit closer from the right. 7.</td>', 'Night pictures, are so difficult, when it comes to technical issues. Very nice composition, lovely colours and use of light. I like the title also. I wish there was more focus on the flowers (berries) on the right and I would''ve cropped it a bit closer from the right. 7.', '2006-05-11 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2405565, 331895, 5746, '<td valign="top">Is it a mirror on the wall in the middle of the picture? Overall I like it very much. Nice composition, a lot of detail. Very moody.</td>', 'Is it a mirror on the wall in the middle of the picture? Overall I like it very much. Nice composition, a lot of detail. Very moody.', '2006-05-11 11:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
