(2405585, 331137, 5746, '<td valign="top">Theese are great colours. Wonderful surroundings (out of this world a bit) and a lot of detail in the picture. Very good choice.</td>', 'Theese are great colours. Wonderful surroundings (out of this world a bit) and a lot of detail in the picture. Very good choice.', '2006-05-11 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
