(2405588, 331925, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like the reflections. Water looks like ice. Quite high amount of detail, nice coposition. The sky is great.Very good. 8.</td>', 'Wow, I like the reflections. Water looks like ice. Quite high amount of detail, nice coposition. The sky is great.Very good. 8.', '2006-05-11 11:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
