(2406223, 332126, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very mystical, reminds me of shots from old 50´s and 60´s movies where they couldn´t shoot at night because of limitations of the equipment and shot night scenes at day but underexposed.  Love the mood in this one, got an 8 from me, very magical.</td>', 'Very mystical, reminds me of shots from old 50´s and 60´s movies where they couldn´t shoot at night because of limitations of the equipment and shot night scenes at day but underexposed.  Love the mood in this one, got an 8 from me, very magical.', '2006-05-11 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
