(2406679, 332288, 57153, '<td valign="top">I like the cleanness of this shot.</td>', 'I like the cleanness of this shot.', '2006-05-11 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406688, 331966, 49326, '<td valign="top">Is it at night. It looks like it''s taken during the day but when i look into the forrest it''s very dark. Maybe it is at night. But anyways very nice photo. I like the smooth water a lot.</td>', 'Is it at night. It looks like it''s taken during the day but when i look into the forrest it''s very dark. Maybe it is at night. But anyways very nice photo. I like the smooth water a lot.', '2006-05-11 17:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406689, 330384, 37879, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!  What an exciting image.  How on earth was this done?  After the challenge, I''d love to hear details.  My only quirp is on the distracting power lines at the bottom...nothing a bit of advanced editing couldn''t handle...<br/> <br/>okay, so now I must continue on.  Reminds me more and more of the tree of wisdom in the Garden of Eden.  This would be a beautiful poster, CD cover, etc.  <br/> <br/>Great work!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!  What an exciting image.  How on earth was this done?  After the challenge, I''d love to hear details.  My only quirp is on the distracting power lines at the bottom...nothing a bit of advanced editing couldn''t handle... okay, so now I must continue on.  Reminds me more and more of the tree of wisdom in the Garden of Eden.  This would be a beautiful poster, CD cover, etc.   Great work!', '2006-05-11 17:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406690, 330772, 49326, '<td valign="top">The lights are beautiful, some are orange and some are blue. The reflection in the water is also nice.</td>', 'The lights are beautiful, some are orange and some are blue. The reflection in the water is also nice.', '2006-05-11 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406695, 331093, 37879, '<td valign="top">gotta be a top finish.  perfect exposure.  beautiful color.  great symmetry.</td>', 'gotta be a top finish.  perfect exposure.  beautiful color.  great symmetry.', '2006-05-11 17:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406697, 331143, 46428, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a photograph like this before.. Very nice.</td>', 'I''ve seen a photograph like this before.. Very nice.', '2006-05-11 17:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406700, 331526, 37879, '<td valign="top">is this a nightlight?  regardless, very cool image...reminds me of 1920''s gangsters...don''t ask me why...good as an abstract</td>', 'is this a nightlight?  regardless, very cool image...reminds me of 1920''s gangsters...don''t ask me why...good as an abstract', '2006-05-11 17:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406706, 332114, 37879, '<td valign="top">nice...I like the angle...makes the buildings look big and scary.  the lights fight a bit too much with the "missed call"...perhaps use a flashlight, etc. to add a bit more attention to that part of the image.  good job!</td>', 'nice...I like the angle...makes the buildings look big and scary.  the lights fight a bit too much with the "missed call"...perhaps use a flashlight, etc. to add a bit more attention to that part of the image.  good job!', '2006-05-11 17:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406709, 332219, 49326, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. The bridge leads the eyes to the building and the darkness eliminates the background and makes nice frame around the subject. The and the reflections are also very nice. (9)</td>', 'I like this one a lot. The bridge leads the eyes to the building and the darkness eliminates the background and makes nice frame around the subject. The and the reflections are also very nice. (9)', '2006-05-11 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406714, 330208, 51750, '<td valign="top">Nice zoom effect.</td>', 'Nice zoom effect.', '2006-05-11 17:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406715, 332447, 37879, '<td valign="top">very moody...perhaps desaturate the blues a bit...looks really cool in the sky, but creates distracting fringing around the edges of the trees</td>', 'very moody...perhaps desaturate the blues a bit...looks really cool in the sky, but creates distracting fringing around the edges of the trees', '2006-05-11 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
