(2406733, 330031, 37879, '<td valign="top">rarely do I like borders, but I think it works here...this circus would give me the heebie jeebies, though! -8</td>', 'rarely do I like borders, but I think it works here...this circus would give me the heebie jeebies, though! -8', '2006-05-11 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
