(2406911, 331609, 37719, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t like in this iamge is the boat.  If it was stationary it would be a stronger element I think.  Moving, in this shot, it becomes a distraction.</td>', 'The only thing I don''t like in this iamge is the boat.  If it was stationary it would be a stronger element I think.  Moving, in this shot, it becomes a distraction.', '2006-05-11 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2406916, 331486, 56673, '<td valign="top">Well, the size constraints really hurt you on this one.  Hard to cram the whole L.V. strip into 640 pixels.  I''d love to see a full-sized version.</td>', 'Well, the size constraints really hurt you on this one.  Hard to cram the whole L.V. strip into 640 pixels.  I''d love to see a full-sized version.', '2006-05-11 18:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
