(2407351, 332209, 19507, '<td valign="top">Really interesting night shot.  It offers a new perspective (at least for me) of the city of lights.</td>', 'Really interesting night shot.  It offers a new perspective (at least for me) of the city of lights.', '2006-05-11 21:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
