(2408518, 331952, 57104, '<td valign="top">This is a good photograph, but I have seen things like this before. Good clarity a little too much glow on the sharpening at the needles of the cactus. Overall not too bad, nice work.</td>', 'This is a good photograph, but I have seen things like this before. Good clarity a little too much glow on the sharpening at the needles of the cactus. Overall not too bad, nice work.', '2006-05-12 03:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408519, 332370, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of shots like this, and I''m beginning to get bored. It''s good, but it doesn''t feel inspired. Sorry.</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of shots like this, and I''m beginning to get bored. It''s good, but it doesn''t feel inspired. Sorry.', '2006-05-12 03:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408522, 330208, 41574, '<td valign="top">Very creative, and with a very pleasing result  I really like it.</td>', 'Very creative, and with a very pleasing result  I really like it.', '2006-05-12 03:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408524, 330368, 41574, '<td valign="top">I have no idea whether you''re blowing bubbles or not; I can''t tell a damned thing regarding what''s happening in this picture. Sorry, but all I see are some colors on a black back-drop.</td>', 'I have no idea whether you''re blowing bubbles or not; I can''t tell a damned thing regarding what''s happening in this picture. Sorry, but all I see are some colors on a black back-drop.', '2006-05-12 03:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408525, 332296, 57104, '<td valign="top">Neat effect. Would have turned out a little cooler if the photographer could have been at a further vantage point to capture the full arrary of both the fireworks and the reflection. Interesting to look at. Nice work.</td>', 'Neat effect. Would have turned out a little cooler if the photographer could have been at a further vantage point to capture the full arrary of both the fireworks and the reflection. Interesting to look at. Nice work.', '2006-05-12 03:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408528, 332331, 57104, '<td valign="top">This photo appears very dark from my viewpoint. It''s difficult to distinguish much of anything in it but dark and a little orange color. Too much night- not enough shot.</td>', 'This photo appears very dark from my viewpoint. It''s difficult to distinguish much of anything in it but dark and a little orange color. Too much night- not enough shot.', '2006-05-12 03:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408533, 330435, 57104, '<td valign="top">Nice clean photograph. I really like this. The double crossing lights and color make it appear like a warm summer night. The angle and viewpoint really pulls the viewr into the scene. Nice placement of composition. Crisp, clean, and simple. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice clean photograph. I really like this. The double crossing lights and color make it appear like a warm summer night. The angle and viewpoint really pulls the viewr into the scene. Nice placement of composition. Crisp, clean, and simple. Nice work.', '2006-05-12 03:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408534, 331250, 57104, '<td valign="top">Good work on the framing with the trees in composition.</td>', 'Good work on the framing with the trees in composition.', '2006-05-12 03:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408538, 330753, 57104, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, yet expecting to see something more majestic in the sillouette though from a shot at Yosemite.  the shot is technically good, the composition could use more interest to make this photo more appealling.</td>', 'I like the photo, yet expecting to see something more majestic in the sillouette though from a shot at Yosemite.  the shot is technically good, the composition could use more interest to make this photo more appealling.', '2006-05-12 03:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408541, 331137, 57104, '<td valign="top">Good contrast &amp; clarity, some of the interesting detail to the right is lost in the shadow, but the vivid sky makes up for it.</td>', 'Good contrast & clarity, some of the interesting detail to the right is lost in the shadow, but the vivid sky makes up for it.', '2006-05-12 03:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408543, 332114, 57104, '<td valign="top">this is a thought provoking photo that draws your eye into the desolute bareness of the alley way. It tells a story, nice work.</td>', 'this is a thought provoking photo that draws your eye into the desolute bareness of the alley way. It tells a story, nice work.', '2006-05-12 03:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408545, 330844, 57104, '<td valign="top">I like flowers a lot, but not at night with flash photography. IMHO I think this would have worked much better as a day shot. Overall it isnt too bad. good clarity.</td>', 'I like flowers a lot, but not at night with flash photography. IMHO I think this would have worked much better as a day shot. Overall it isnt too bad. good clarity.', '2006-05-12 03:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408547, 332458, 57104, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on the lightning, good timing.</td>', 'Nice capture on the lightning, good timing.', '2006-05-12 03:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
