(2408552, 329590, 57104, '<td valign="top">A little glare. I think the photographer has a nice eye for composition. This could be brought up a bit in curves/ISO or taken earlier in the evening with a lighter sky to bring out just a little more detail in the ship. as it is it seems over shadowed with night a little too much losing the effectiveness of this great composition.</td>', 'A little glare. I think the photographer has a nice eye for composition. This could be brought up a bit in curves/ISO or taken earlier in the evening with a lighter sky to bring out just a little more detail in the ship. as it is it seems over shadowed with night a little too much losing the effectiveness of this great composition.', '2006-05-12 04:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408553, 332114, 5746, '<td valign="top">One of my winners. It has a feeling and a story behind. Great. 10.</td>', 'One of my winners. It has a feeling and a story behind. Great. 10.', '2006-05-12 04:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
