(2408570, 331869, 57104, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, I like the perspective. It''s a little too dark at the bottom and IMHO would have looked sharper with more water reflection/detail since the eye focus falls there in the black spot first. Overall it''s interesting and pleasing to look at. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, I like the perspective. It''s a little too dark at the bottom and IMHO would have looked sharper with more water reflection/detail since the eye focus falls there in the black spot first. Overall it''s interesting and pleasing to look at. Nice work.', '2006-05-12 04:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
