(2408589, 332475, 57104, '<td valign="top">This photo could use more clarity, it doesnt have the pop I would expect against its geometric shape with such a dark backdrop. Maybe a slightly different angle would have given more to the photograph. Impossible to know all the conditions for the photographer and camera, but looks like a tricky lighting situation with a shadow overcast to contend with. Overall it is interesting and original. Nice work considering the many possible technical challenges in attempting a shot like this.</td>', 'This photo could use more clarity, it doesnt have the pop I would expect against its geometric shape with such a dark backdrop. Maybe a slightly different angle would have given more to the photograph. Impossible to know all the conditions for the photographer and camera, but looks like a tricky lighting situation with a shadow overcast to contend with. Overall it is interesting and original. Nice work considering the many possible technical challenges in attempting a shot like this.', '2006-05-12 04:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2408591, 331513, 57104, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, I think the black border distracts a bit, but the photo itself is appealing. The depth is nice with the poles contrasting against the vivid sky. Nice catch on the light.</td>', 'Nice photograph, I think the black border distracts a bit, but the photo itself is appealing. The depth is nice with the poles contrasting against the vivid sky. Nice catch on the light.', '2006-05-12 04:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
