(2409388, 332222, 23953, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines. The "hot spot" on the bottom of the frame is a little distracting. Also, it seems like the top of the building is blurry.</td>', 'Good leading lines. The "hot spot" on the bottom of the frame is a little distracting. Also, it seems like the top of the building is blurry.', '2006-05-12 12:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2409389, 330351, 23953, '<td valign="top">hmmm....what sport is this? Great wide angle shot. IMO, I think (a) if there were more people is would be more effective, or (b) with less people like you have it, maybe take the photo when someone scores. It may look like the stadium is more full. I don''t know though...just suggestions<br/> <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'hmmm....what sport is this? Great wide angle shot. IMO, I think (a) if there were more people is would be more effective, or (b) with less people like you have it, maybe take the photo when someone scores. It may look like the stadium is more full. I don''t know though...just suggestions Good Luck', '2006-05-12 12:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2409390, 331577, 9696, '<td valign="top">beautiful and romantic...</td>', 'beautiful and romantic...', '2006-05-12 12:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2409391, 330785, 7291, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and the big splash of blue on the tower.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the softness and the big splash of blue on the tower.  Nice work.', '2006-05-12 12:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2409393, 330036, 7291, '<td valign="top">This is the same picture and angle from Konador''s video on Unsharp Mask.  Pretty nice picture.</td>', 'This is the same picture and angle from Konador''s video on Unsharp Mask.  Pretty nice picture.', '2006-05-12 12:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2409396, 332481, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent anticipation on catching the plane turning.  Is this the spot over the river where all planes going into Regan have to make that shapr turn?</td>', 'Excellent anticipation on catching the plane turning.  Is this the spot over the river where all planes going into Regan have to make that shapr turn?', '2006-05-12 12:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2409397, 332447, 7291, '<td valign="top">Eerie effect.</td>', 'Eerie effect.', '2006-05-12 12:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
