(2411361, 332285, 23579, '<td valign="top">I like the way you can see the rays of light coming from the street lamps. In my oppinion, that along with the reflection are the most interesting parts of the photo. The part on the left is too dark, and you can''t see much detail. You should try to focus on the nice lighting, and see what you can make of it.</td>', 'I like the way you can see the rays of light coming from the street lamps. In my oppinion, that along with the reflection are the most interesting parts of the photo. The part on the left is too dark, and you can''t see much detail. You should try to focus on the nice lighting, and see what you can make of it.', '2006-05-13 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411372, 332235, 23579, '<td valign="top">Great pattern of shadows. Good job with finding such good lighting, but I think the composition could be improved to enhance the shadows.</td>', 'Great pattern of shadows. Good job with finding such good lighting, but I think the composition could be improved to enhance the shadows.', '2006-05-13 02:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411374, 332370, 57525, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that could have been top 15 with a couple of changes.  Some suggestions:<br/>1.  Consider finding a way to fram the image without the street light.  For me, it''s a bit distracting.<br/>2. The horizon is a bit low, I would have raised it and gotten less sky.<br/>3. Consider playing with the shadows/highlights if you have PS CS2.  Also, consider playing with curves and levels to bring out the clouds in the sky.  <br/> <br/>I know people always ask for critiques; I''m not a great photographer, so take these thoughts with a grain of salt, but I hope they''re useful!</td>', 'This is one of those photos that could have been top 15 with a couple of changes.  Some suggestions:1.  Consider finding a way to fram the image without the street light.  For me, it''s a bit distracting.2. The horizon is a bit low, I would have raised it and gotten less sky.3. Consider playing with the shadows/highlights if you have PS CS2.  Also, consider playing with curves and levels to bring out the clouds in the sky.   I know people always ask for critiques; I''m not a great photographer, so take these thoughts with a grain of salt, but I hope they''re useful!', '2006-05-13 02:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411378, 332114, 23579, '<td valign="top">I like the colors you have here. The colors and the lighting add a nice dramatic mood to the photo. It seems like a scene from an older movie.</td>', 'I like the colors you have here. The colors and the lighting add a nice dramatic mood to the photo. It seems like a scene from an older movie.', '2006-05-13 02:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411386, 332213, 57525, '<td valign="top">Really wierd.. I like the ghost person, and all of the lights.  Water looks nice and crisp.  Interesting photograph, I kinda wish I had a better clue as to what I was looking at from the title.</td>', 'Really wierd.. I like the ghost person, and all of the lights.  Water looks nice and crisp.  Interesting photograph, I kinda wish I had a better clue as to what I was looking at from the title.', '2006-05-13 02:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411387, 330769, 23579, '<td valign="top">I like the way the building is lit and seems to be floating in the air. However I think you can improve the photo by picking a different perspective and a wider focal length. You could add a sense of place or scale by choosing to include more buildings or other objects.</td>', 'I like the way the building is lit and seems to be floating in the air. However I think you can improve the photo by picking a different perspective and a wider focal length. You could add a sense of place or scale by choosing to include more buildings or other objects.', '2006-05-13 02:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411391, 332290, 57525, '<td valign="top">Where in cambridge did you shoot this from?  Looks like a nice shot, but you shrunk the image too much.</td>', 'Where in cambridge did you shoot this from?  Looks like a nice shot, but you shrunk the image too much.', '2006-05-13 02:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411403, 331099, 23579, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting  toward the top of the photo. Maybe you could pick a different perspective and include more of it. Maybe you can even have it highlighting something or someone. Also, the lens flare on the left is distracting. One way of preventing that is to shade the lens with your hand, so that light isn''t hitting the lens directly.</td>', 'I like the lighting  toward the top of the photo. Maybe you could pick a different perspective and include more of it. Maybe you can even have it highlighting something or someone. Also, the lens flare on the left is distracting. One way of preventing that is to shade the lens with your hand, so that light isn''t hitting the lens directly.', '2006-05-13 02:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411423, 330298, 23579, '<td valign="top">I like the way the space needle stands out from the rest of the buildings. It''s bright while everything else is dark. You should try taking the picture earlier in the night, when the sky is still a deep blue, so that the buildings in the background become silhouettes. That way they wouldn''t blend into the dark sky. Also the blue thing in the bottom left corner could be cropped out. It doesn''t seem to fit in very well.</td>', 'I like the way the space needle stands out from the rest of the buildings. It''s bright while everything else is dark. You should try taking the picture earlier in the night, when the sky is still a deep blue, so that the buildings in the background become silhouettes. That way they wouldn''t blend into the dark sky. Also the blue thing in the bottom left corner could be cropped out. It doesn''t seem to fit in very well.', '2006-05-13 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411428, 332469, 23579, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture. I like the colors. It gives it a sort of old feel. I would like to see more of what is on the right. Extending the picture on the right would put the station in the left third of the frame. Also, I''ve noticed that pictures get scored better if they show a story. To add more to your story, you could have someone pose in or around the station.</td>', 'Awesome picture. I like the colors. It gives it a sort of old feel. I would like to see more of what is on the right. Extending the picture on the right would put the station in the left third of the frame. Also, I''ve noticed that pictures get scored better if they show a story. To add more to your story, you could have someone pose in or around the station.', '2006-05-13 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411434, 329961, 45224, '<td valign="top">Best reflections so far.. nice shot. 8!</td>', 'Best reflections so far.. nice shot. 8!', '2006-05-13 02:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411435, 331952, 45224, '<td valign="top">Well chosen POV :)</td>', 'Well chosen POV :)', '2006-05-13 02:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411436, 332067, 45224, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2006-05-13 02:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411437, 332210, 45224, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s because I have a calibrated monitor but this picture appears to me as being washed out and way too bright :S Could also be just my tastes, I don''t know.<br/> <br/>Otherwise cool shot.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s because I have a calibrated monitor but this picture appears to me as being washed out and way too bright :S Could also be just my tastes, I don''t know. Otherwise cool shot.', '2006-05-13 02:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411439, 331195, 45224, '<td valign="top">Well I can''t say much. This is a real good and detailed shot. I wish I had equipment to take that kind of shot :)</td>', 'Well I can''t say much. This is a real good and detailed shot. I wish I had equipment to take that kind of shot :)', '2006-05-13 02:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411440, 331041, 23579, '<td valign="top">I like your composition in this photo. One nit picky detail is that the white balance for the man and the building do not match. One way to fix this is to put a orangish-yellow filter over your flash to make the color of your flash closer to the ambient lighting. The filter could be homemade or bought. Anything tansparent would work.</td>', 'I like your composition in this photo. One nit picky detail is that the white balance for the man and the building do not match. One way to fix this is to put a orangish-yellow filter over your flash to make the color of your flash closer to the ambient lighting. The filter could be homemade or bought. Anything tansparent would work.', '2006-05-13 02:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411447, 332219, 45224, '<td valign="top">cool POV and colors.</td>', 'cool POV and colors.', '2006-05-13 02:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411448, 332191, 23579, '<td valign="top">You captured some nice details of this building. The lighting is very good and accents the details. One thing that hurts the photo is the wall on the right. It adds nothing to the picture. You could repostion your tripod and camera over to the left some more in order to get rid of the wall.</td>', 'You captured some nice details of this building. The lighting is very good and accents the details. One thing that hurts the photo is the wall on the right. It adds nothing to the picture. You could repostion your tripod and camera over to the left some more in order to get rid of the wall.', '2006-05-13 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411450, 331126, 57525, '<td valign="top">Water looks amazing, although I would love to have seen some of the highlights darkened a bit and shadows brought out more.</td>', 'Water looks amazing, although I would love to have seen some of the highlights darkened a bit and shadows brought out more.', '2006-05-13 02:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411453, 330547, 45224, '<td valign="top">nice landscape.</td>', 'nice landscape.', '2006-05-13 02:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411610, 332331, 48545, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, really like it, I''ll be watching this one to see how it does.  A lot of people might be using LCDs and it is amazing how this image changes with the angle that you are sitting at.  I checked the white/black balance and at exactly the right level it is perfect! (if you move the laptopscreen back and forth it creates quite an eerie effect!  I hope people don''t say it is too dark. Good luck</td>', 'Interesting picture, really like it, I''ll be watching this one to see how it does.  A lot of people might be using LCDs and it is amazing how this image changes with the angle that you are sitting at.  I checked the white/black balance and at exactly the right level it is perfect! (if you move the laptopscreen back and forth it creates quite an eerie effect!  I hope people don''t say it is too dark. Good luck', '2006-05-13 04:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2411663, 330542, 57535, '<td valign="top">i really like this. it''s isolated, cold and familiar.</td>', 'i really like this. it''s isolated, cold and familiar.', '2006-05-13 05:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
