(2412304, 331963, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the ghost effect of the bus with the long shutter, but it looks as thought you just pulled to the side of the street and took a shot.  I can understand maybe not wanting to get out of the car in a bad neighborhood or something, but just turning off the headlights and aiming up a bit higher to not get the car roof would have helped (or just crop off the bottom).</td>', 'I like the ghost effect of the bus with the long shutter, but it looks as thought you just pulled to the side of the street and took a shot.  I can understand maybe not wanting to get out of the car in a bad neighborhood or something, but just turning off the headlights and aiming up a bit higher to not get the car roof would have helped (or just crop off the bottom).', '2006-05-13 15:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
