(2412903, 331809, 1454, '<td valign="top">Liked it!!</td>', 'Liked it!!', '2006-05-13 21:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412904, 332056, 1454, '<td valign="top">Liked it!</td>', 'Liked it!', '2006-05-13 21:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412905, 332214, 14476, '<td valign="top">This was an interesting experiment.  I expect you used a tripod, but perhaps there was wind, so the trees are not sharp.  And the flow of the clouds wasn''t quite enough to give definite movement.  Bracketing helps in these experiments.  The one thing I would suggest in composition is that little dark area to the lower left.  If you cropped just above that, it would remove an avoidable distraction.  I really like what you tried to do here - keep up the experimentation.</td>', 'This was an interesting experiment.  I expect you used a tripod, but perhaps there was wind, so the trees are not sharp.  And the flow of the clouds wasn''t quite enough to give definite movement.  Bracketing helps in these experiments.  The one thing I would suggest in composition is that little dark area to the lower left.  If you cropped just above that, it would remove an avoidable distraction.  I really like what you tried to do here - keep up the experimentation.', '2006-05-13 21:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412907, 330325, 1454, '<td valign="top">Liked it...</td>', 'Liked it...', '2006-05-13 21:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412909, 332401, 45524, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the photo, and the colors. The clarity is good. I wonder about the tilted horizon though. Makes me want to lean my head to the left to get a good look at it. I''d prefer it to be straight, but kudos to you for taking the chance.</td>', 'Wow, I love the photo, and the colors. The clarity is good. I wonder about the tilted horizon though. Makes me want to lean my head to the left to get a good look at it. I''d prefer it to be straight, but kudos to you for taking the chance.', '2006-05-13 21:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412910, 332433, 14476, '<td valign="top">Up a point or two for the use of complimentary colors in your very nice compostion.</td>', 'Up a point or two for the use of complimentary colors in your very nice compostion.', '2006-05-13 21:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412914, 330772, 1454, '<td valign="top">Like it@</td>', 'Like it@', '2006-05-13 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412916, 331693, 1454, '<td valign="top">Liked it!</td>', 'Liked it!', '2006-05-13 21:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412917, 332235, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s another of those images I''m a sucker for.  Take an everyday object and show us something new.  It may (or may not) score well overall, but it scores high in my book.  (and, yes, I wish those white &amp; red auto light trails weren''t there)  But, oh, I do like what you did with the light in that fence.</td>', 'Well, here''s another of those images I''m a sucker for.  Take an everyday object and show us something new.  It may (or may not) score well overall, but it scores high in my book.  (and, yes, I wish those white & red auto light trails weren''t there)  But, oh, I do like what you did with the light in that fence.', '2006-05-13 21:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412918, 330547, 1454, '<td valign="top">Loved it!!</td>', 'Loved it!!', '2006-05-13 21:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412920, 332452, 1454, '<td valign="top">Liked it...</td>', 'Liked it...', '2006-05-13 21:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412921, 331879, 1454, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2006-05-13 21:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412923, 330844, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  However, the lighting is sadly flat.  I believe that even two flashlights hidden in the leaves pointing back toward the camera, yet trained on one bloom of your choosing could add a bit of pizzazz to the yellow of the bloom &amp; the photo overall.<br/>   I am making mental note of this one for just that purpose.  Thanks.</td>', 'Great subject!  However, the lighting is sadly flat.  I believe that even two flashlights hidden in the leaves pointing back toward the camera, yet trained on one bloom of your choosing could add a bit of pizzazz to the yellow of the bloom & the photo overall.   I am making mental note of this one for just that purpose.  Thanks.', '2006-05-13 21:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412925, 331974, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh,this image comes sooo close!  Love the movement in the tram.  But think about cropping it to eliminate the signs "hotel" and "schaepp.."  You still get all the effect of the moving vehicle without the distractions of the lettering. <br/> <br/>What a good job of seeing!</td>', 'Oh,this image comes sooo close!  Love the movement in the tram.  But think about cropping it to eliminate the signs "hotel" and "schaepp.."  You still get all the effect of the moving vehicle without the distractions of the lettering.  What a good job of seeing!', '2006-05-13 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412926, 332278, 50034, '<td valign="top">YES!!!!!!!</td>', 'YES!!!!!!!', '2006-05-13 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412927, 332181, 1454, '<td valign="top">Liked it!</td>', 'Liked it!', '2006-05-13 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412928, 330376, 14476, '<td valign="top">The foreground makes this image stand out from the rest.  NICE one.</td>', 'The foreground makes this image stand out from the rest.  NICE one.', '2006-05-13 21:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412929, 330578, 1454, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!</td>', 'Great shot!!', '2006-05-13 21:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412933, 331098, 14476, '<td valign="top">Futuristic indeed!  <br/> <br/>Looks like something the government doesn''t want us to see.<br/>;&gt;)</td>', 'Futuristic indeed!   Looks like something the government doesn''t want us to see.;>)', '2006-05-13 21:29:16.000000', NULL, 1);
