(2412936, 329590, 14476, '<td valign="top">And we are off to faraway places.  Well done, especially in the exposure.  There could have been hot spots all over the place.  You corrected for them.</td>', 'And we are off to faraway places.  Well done, especially in the exposure.  There could have been hot spots all over the place.  You corrected for them.', '2006-05-13 21:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
