(2412944, 330352, 54728, '<td valign="top">did you change the color tone to reddish-orange?  because I''d have to say, I''d like it better in a subtler tone.  This is a little too harsh.  Maybe a cool color would work better than a warm, since it''s a night photo. I like the idea tho. :)</td>', 'did you change the color tone to reddish-orange?  because I''d have to say, I''d like it better in a subtler tone.  This is a little too harsh.  Maybe a cool color would work better than a warm, since it''s a night photo. I like the idea tho. :)', '2006-05-13 21:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2412945, 332205, 54728, '<td valign="top">nice placement</td>', 'nice placement', '2006-05-13 21:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
