(2412981, 330840, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  It''s interesting that the cross at at the end. Hmmm <br/> <br/>I like the touch of the steel blue tones amidst all of the warmer ones.</td>', 'Really nice.  It''s interesting that the cross at at the end. Hmmm  I like the touch of the steel blue tones amidst all of the warmer ones.', '2006-05-13 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
