(2413244, 332371, 19978, '<td valign="top">Quite a few clouds there. Hope you have a promising forecast! Nice color gradient in the clouds and a good silhouette. Not really enough to carry the shot though. I think you need a starry sky, or at least a deep, dark, not-obviously-cloudy sky.</td>', 'Quite a few clouds there. Hope you have a promising forecast! Nice color gradient in the clouds and a good silhouette. Not really enough to carry the shot though. I think you need a starry sky, or at least a deep, dark, not-obviously-cloudy sky.', '2006-05-14 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
