(2415601, 332168, 41574, '<td valign="top">The picture''s just a little too bright to evoke a "night-time" response. It''s a nice shot, but I wish it were a bit heavier on the shadows. As a "night shot," I want the image to convey a sense of loneliness and trepidation, and the overly-bright ambiance works against that goal. Altogether, it''s good, but it could have been significantly better.</td>', 'The picture''s just a little too bright to evoke a "night-time" response. It''s a nice shot, but I wish it were a bit heavier on the shadows. As a "night shot," I want the image to convey a sense of loneliness and trepidation, and the overly-bright ambiance works against that goal. Altogether, it''s good, but it could have been significantly better.', '2006-05-15 00:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415602, 332443, 41574, '<td valign="top">Too under-exposed.</td>', 'Too under-exposed.', '2006-05-15 00:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415606, 332451, 41574, '<td valign="top">Shaky, poorly-composed image. It looks as though it were hastily snapped off with a decent camera-phone. Also, the horizon is noticeably tilted, and that seriously hurts the picture.</td>', 'Shaky, poorly-composed image. It looks as though it were hastily snapped off with a decent camera-phone. Also, the horizon is noticeably tilted, and that seriously hurts the picture.', '2006-05-15 00:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
