(2415610, 331952, 41574, '<td valign="top">Sweet star-trail shot. As always, the foreground makes or breaks this type of image, and, luckily, your does the former...well. Great work.</td>', 'Sweet star-trail shot. As always, the foreground makes or breaks this type of image, and, luckily, your does the former...well. Great work.', '2006-05-15 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
