(2415673, 331407, 41574, '<td valign="top">As this is more a "candid" than a "night-shot" (which would rely on "night" to achieve an effect), I find it difficult to rate it. I can''t say that it doesn''t qualify for the challenge as, indeed, I believe you took it at night, but I can''t praise it for creativity, either. I guess...it''s just "OK."</td>', 'As this is more a "candid" than a "night-shot" (which would rely on "night" to achieve an effect), I find it difficult to rate it. I can''t say that it doesn''t qualify for the challenge as, indeed, I believe you took it at night, but I can''t praise it for creativity, either. I guess...it''s just "OK."', '2006-05-15 00:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415675, 331948, 41574, '<td valign="top">Way too much noice, yet too dark to be of any real interest. Sorry.</td>', 'Way too much noice, yet too dark to be of any real interest. Sorry.', '2006-05-15 00:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
