(2419943, 332490, 46819, '<td valign="top">digital cameras always have trouble coping with dark scenes, try and avoid photographing a direct source of light to prevent that ''faded'' effect. Nice shot though (7)</td>', 'digital cameras always have trouble coping with dark scenes, try and avoid photographing a direct source of light to prevent that ''faded'' effect. Nice shot though (7)', '2006-05-16 07:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419946, 331948, 46819, '<td valign="top">unfortunately digital cameras tend to fade out colour and pixelate in dark conditions. I''d suggest a longer exposure and a bit of brightness and contrast tweaking to make this a winning shot. I like the colour though.</td>', 'unfortunately digital cameras tend to fade out colour and pixelate in dark conditions. I''d suggest a longer exposure and a bit of brightness and contrast tweaking to make this a winning shot. I like the colour though.', '2006-05-16 07:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419950, 332282, 46819, '<td valign="top">very nice picture, I like the white-on-black contrast, allows for a dramatic photo. The only slightly distracting element is the lights on the bottom right of the photo, could''ve done with a different angle possibly? (7)</td>', 'very nice picture, I like the white-on-black contrast, allows for a dramatic photo. The only slightly distracting element is the lights on the bottom right of the photo, could''ve done with a different angle possibly? (7)', '2006-05-16 07:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419952, 330834, 46819, '<td valign="top">Nice idea/photo, try to avoid photographing direct light sources to prevent a faded photo. The reflections and water, however, are well caught. 8</td>', 'Nice idea/photo, try to avoid photographing direct light sources to prevent a faded photo. The reflections and water, however, are well caught. 8', '2006-05-16 07:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419953, 332290, 46819, '<td valign="top">Nice city shot, but could''ve done with a larger photo to see it! For the future, perhaps taking the photo at a later time would create more of a contrast between the lights and sky. 6</td>', 'Nice city shot, but could''ve done with a larger photo to see it! For the future, perhaps taking the photo at a later time would create more of a contrast between the lights and sky. 6', '2006-05-16 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419954, 332331, 46819, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot, the long exposure doubles up for the ghostly effect as well as a good night shot. Perhaps a little higher contrast though, to accent the gravestone sillouettes... 8</td>', 'Nicely shot, the long exposure doubles up for the ghostly effect as well as a good night shot. Perhaps a little higher contrast though, to accent the gravestone sillouettes... 8', '2006-05-16 07:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419956, 332150, 46819, '<td valign="top">Good photograph, shame the building to the right is blurred, kinda ruins the overall effect. 6</td>', 'Good photograph, shame the building to the right is blurred, kinda ruins the overall effect. 6', '2006-05-16 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419961, 332334, 46819, '<td valign="top">good photograph, has the elements of active dance as well as the tranquility of a house at night. Could possibly do with (a) cropping out the odd lens-covering-object in the top right, and (b) cropping out some more of that grainy sky that digital cameras try to over-compensate for. 8</td>', 'good photograph, has the elements of active dance as well as the tranquility of a house at night. Could possibly do with (a) cropping out the odd lens-covering-object in the top right, and (b) cropping out some more of that grainy sky that digital cameras try to over-compensate for. 8', '2006-05-16 07:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419962, 332072, 46819, '<td valign="top">wow, this is a very effective photo with dark/light contrasts as well as the well accented individual eyelashes. Good detail:contrast ratio. 8</td>', 'wow, this is a very effective photo with dark/light contrasts as well as the well accented individual eyelashes. Good detail:contrast ratio. 8', '2006-05-16 07:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419966, 329509, 46819, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, but I''d place it in a holiday album rather than a night shot competition. I think it would be slightly more impressive if the back ground were more interesting, and there was less light that wasn''t caused by the fire. I''ll give you 8 for the skill of capturing, but 4 for the scene, setting and relevance. So I leave it at 6.</td>', 'This is a good shot, but I''d place it in a holiday album rather than a night shot competition. I think it would be slightly more impressive if the back ground were more interesting, and there was less light that wasn''t caused by the fire. I''ll give you 8 for the skill of capturing, but 4 for the scene, setting and relevance. So I leave it at 6.', '2006-05-16 07:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419968, 332476, 57791, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like to see the moon focused instead.</td>', 'I think I would have like to see the moon focused instead.', '2006-05-16 07:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419969, 332168, 46819, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, the woman has the right expression for the shot, and the depth of field achieves a good overall effect. However, I think that perhaps a more interesting or plainer background would have been slightly more effective and possibly greater detail on the flower (?) being held, looks a little like some form of ice cream scoop... Nicely taken though with crisp edges and effective lighting. 7</td>', 'This is a good photo, the woman has the right expression for the shot, and the depth of field achieves a good overall effect. However, I think that perhaps a more interesting or plainer background would have been slightly more effective and possibly greater detail on the flower (?) being held, looks a little like some form of ice cream scoop... Nicely taken though with crisp edges and effective lighting. 7', '2006-05-16 07:59:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2419973, 331414, 46270, '<td valign="top">Not your normal nightshot...It''s fresh and beautifully done. I like.</td>', 'Not your normal nightshot...It''s fresh and beautifully done. I like.', '2006-05-16 08:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419974, 330844, 46819, '<td valign="top">This is a good opurtunity for a great photo. However, it''s a shame that so much of the colour has been lost from the light source illuminating the tulips. I can''t tell whether it was a camera flash or a light behind you, but when shooting night shots with colours, always try to go for the long exposure rather than artifical lighting. 6</td>', 'This is a good opurtunity for a great photo. However, it''s a shame that so much of the colour has been lost from the light source illuminating the tulips. I can''t tell whether it was a camera flash or a light behind you, but when shooting night shots with colours, always try to go for the long exposure rather than artifical lighting. 6', '2006-05-16 08:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419997, 331873, 38032, '<td valign="top">cool.  assuming this is a pretty clear burning plant.  Can''t say the same about Cleveland.</td>', 'cool.  assuming this is a pretty clear burning plant.  Can''t say the same about Cleveland.', '2006-05-16 08:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419998, 332493, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice simplicity.</td>', 'nice simplicity.', '2006-05-16 08:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420000, 332490, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling here.  Good composition. The moment is captured nicely.  The soft noise reduction? works well here.  7</td>', 'I like the feeling here.  Good composition. The moment is captured nicely.  The soft noise reduction? works well here.  7', '2006-05-16 08:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420001, 332356, 38032, '<td valign="top">love it! -  a little slanty but doesn''t really damage the photo - maybe works to its advantage.  7</td>', 'love it! -  a little slanty but doesn''t really damage the photo - maybe works to its advantage.  7', '2006-05-16 08:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420003, 330782, 38032, '<td valign="top">Awesome subject.  The reflections and lines are exceptional.</td>', 'Awesome subject.  The reflections and lines are exceptional.', '2006-05-16 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420005, 332213, 38032, '<td valign="top">Lots to look at here.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Lots to look at here.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-16 08:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420008, 332219, 38032, '<td valign="top">WOW!  - the contrast here is great. POV very interesting here too. 8</td>', 'WOW!  - the contrast here is great. POV very interesting here too. 8', '2006-05-16 08:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420010, 330208, 38032, '<td valign="top">That''s impressive.  I can''t even imagine how this was done - doesn''t look possible with a zoom blur.</td>', 'That''s impressive.  I can''t even imagine how this was done - doesn''t look possible with a zoom blur.', '2006-05-16 08:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420011, 331973, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the amount of space dedicated to water - a little diifferent than similar subject matter images.</td>', 'I like the amount of space dedicated to water - a little diifferent than similar subject matter images.', '2006-05-16 08:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420013, 331414, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice classic feeling to this.</td>', 'Nice classic feeling to this.', '2006-05-16 08:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420014, 330552, 51759, '<td valign="top">Is that motion blur or focal blur? Something tells me it isn''t motion... Also, I believe it is spelled "cinco," with a C.</td>', 'Is that motion blur or focal blur? Something tells me it isn''t motion... Also, I believe it is spelled "cinco," with a C.', '2006-05-16 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420016, 331192, 38032, '<td valign="top">these are always a favorite -  I really like everything here.  It seems a little vacant in regard to life - not necessarilly a bad thing.</td>', 'these are always a favorite -  I really like everything here.  It seems a little vacant in regard to life - not necessarilly a bad thing.', '2006-05-16 08:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420019, 332444, 38032, '<td valign="top">great color and beautiful choice of subject.  this is now a fave of mine. :) 8</td>', 'great color and beautiful choice of subject.  this is now a fave of mine. :) 8', '2006-05-16 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420023, 332209, 38032, '<td valign="top">WWW WOW! dot calm .... that''s freakin'' great.</td>', 'WWW WOW! dot calm .... that''s freakin'' great.', '2006-05-16 08:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420026, 332469, 51759, '<td valign="top">Love the effect the dust creates. Good job!</td>', 'Love the effect the dust creates. Good job!', '2006-05-16 08:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420027, 331968, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like this - i wish i could see the figures more separated from the background but overall is intriguing.</td>', 'I like this - i wish i could see the figures more separated from the background but overall is intriguing.', '2006-05-16 08:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420029, 330547, 36328, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. The only one I gave a 10 out of all 282 images. I love the tonal reflection in the water, and the lonely figure on the headland. Very little noise which is great for the low light. Love the mood, love comp, love everything about this one. Rock on.....Blue ribbon I''m sure.</td>', 'This is fantastic. The only one I gave a 10 out of all 282 images. I love the tonal reflection in the water, and the lonely figure on the headland. Very little noise which is great for the low light. Love the mood, love comp, love everything about this one. Rock on.....Blue ribbon I''m sure.', '2006-05-16 08:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420039, 330174, 36328, '<td valign="top">IMOH the best ''Landmark at night'' picture of the challenge. This certainly is a great new viewpoint on the classic london picture. I''ll be giving this ago next time I''m in London at night! (9)</td>', 'IMOH the best ''Landmark at night'' picture of the challenge. This certainly is a great new viewpoint on the classic london picture. I''ll be giving this ago next time I''m in London at night! (9)', '2006-05-16 08:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420049, 329958, 51759, '<td valign="top">A square crop rarely deserves an off-centred subject.</td>', 'A square crop rarely deserves an off-centred subject.', '2006-05-16 08:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420052, 329959, 51759, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Very imaginative.</td>', 'Fantastic. Very imaginative.', '2006-05-16 08:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420053, 330960, 55571, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2006-05-16 08:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420054, 330208, 51759, '<td valign="top">Good image, though I''m not sure what the street lamps in the bottom right corner do for it. Has an interesting "pulse" feel to it.</td>', 'Good image, though I''m not sure what the street lamps in the bottom right corner do for it. Has an interesting "pulse" feel to it.', '2006-05-16 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420057, 332401, 13759, '<td valign="top">I woudl like it less changed in the PS. It seems to be very pushed in Shadow/Highlights or Curves resulting in a strange contrast.</td>', 'I woudl like it less changed in the PS. It seems to be very pushed in Shadow/Highlights or Curves resulting in a strange contrast.', '2006-05-16 08:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420060, 331904, 13759, '<td valign="top">A bit boring due to lack of focus.</td>', 'A bit boring due to lack of focus.', '2006-05-16 08:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420065, 332343, 13759, '<td valign="top">Too dark picture. A new composition with brings more light to the entire picture can works well.</td>', 'Too dark picture. A new composition with brings more light to the entire picture can works well.', '2006-05-16 08:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420069, 332230, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s a bit fuzzy to me. I can´t identify the elements.</td>', 'It´s a bit fuzzy to me. I can´t identify the elements.', '2006-05-16 08:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420076, 331693, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s a good subject to photograph at night. But you need to catch up more light to the camera. Try to use a higher ISO or more exposure time. And angle with less direct light in front of camera can help to get a longer exposure without blow out.</td>', 'It´s a good subject to photograph at night. But you need to catch up more light to the camera. Try to use a higher ISO or more exposure time. And angle with less direct light in front of camera can help to get a longer exposure without blow out.', '2006-05-16 08:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420081, 332009, 13759, '<td valign="top">Too dark to me!</td>', 'Too dark to me!', '2006-05-16 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420084, 331948, 13759, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Try to give it a higher ISO or more time to exposure.</td>', 'Good subject. Try to give it a higher ISO or more time to exposure.', '2006-05-16 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420091, 331723, 13759, '<td valign="top">The horihon line is weird here, no? I can be simply perspective, and it´s easy to corect in PS (rotate canvas, freely +- 1º). This kind of picture is very impressive. But you need to bring out more light. It can be done with higher ISO. In a cloudy night, the low clouds reflect the city light giving you a great vision. Try it some day.</td>', 'The horihon line is weird here, no? I can be simply perspective, and it´s easy to corect in PS (rotate canvas, freely +- 1º). This kind of picture is very impressive. But you need to bring out more light. It can be done with higher ISO. In a cloudy night, the low clouds reflect the city light giving you a great vision. Try it some day.', '2006-05-16 09:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420095, 332178, 13759, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture. At right time. This has a good mod and you catch it out perfectly.</td>', 'Amazing picture. At right time. This has a good mod and you catch it out perfectly.', '2006-05-16 09:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420098, 332290, 13759, '<td valign="top">I love this one. Due to low image size is very dificult to judge it. If you post a larger one surelly you had get best results.</td>', 'I love this one. Due to low image size is very dificult to judge it. If you post a larger one surelly you had get best results.', '2006-05-16 09:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420111, 331137, 13759, '<td valign="top">The colors are great. Very fabulous view. The only issue is the perspective that seems to be weird. May be a simply 1º of canvas rotation CCW in PS put it perfectly.</td>', 'The colors are great. Very fabulous view. The only issue is the perspective that seems to be weird. May be a simply 1º of canvas rotation CCW in PS put it perfectly.', '2006-05-16 09:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420115, 330840, 25355, '<td valign="top">You could have entered this in Holy Places as well, with the cross at the end of the pier. ;-)  <br/>  Very nice effect of the lighting on the waves.</td>', 'You could have entered this in Holy Places as well, with the cross at the end of the pier. ;-)    Very nice effect of the lighting on the waves.', '2006-05-16 09:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420169, 331922, 48545, '<td valign="top">found this very hard to work out what was going on. I''m guessing it is someone walking back to their tent.  Unfortunately, the sky and the cliff/cave? doesn''t stand out enough to tell the necessary story.</td>', 'found this very hard to work out what was going on. I''m guessing it is someone walking back to their tent.  Unfortunately, the sky and the cliff/cave? doesn''t stand out enough to tell the necessary story.', '2006-05-16 09:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420171, 332359, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, looks like there has been a little bit of camera shake as everything looks a little soft.</td>', 'Nice colours, looks like there has been a little bit of camera shake as everything looks a little soft.', '2006-05-16 09:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420240, 330948, 25735, '<td valign="top">simply say AMAZING. I need to give it 10.</td>', 'simply say AMAZING. I need to give it 10.', '2006-05-16 10:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420311, 331466, 56567, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a little more detail on the un-lit building. Nice reflection tho.</td>', 'I would have liked a little more detail on the un-lit building. Nice reflection tho.', '2006-05-16 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420313, 332387, 56567, '<td valign="top">Love the colour of the sky - reminds me of skate pictures. The trees cvould be sharper tho. Like the colours in the lights.</td>', 'Love the colour of the sky - reminds me of skate pictures. The trees cvould be sharper tho. Like the colours in the lights.', '2006-05-16 10:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420316, 332401, 56567, '<td valign="top">Too busy, I would have cropped a lot shorter and kept the width to make it really interesting.</td>', 'Too busy, I would have cropped a lot shorter and kept the width to make it really interesting.', '2006-05-16 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420317, 332453, 56567, '<td valign="top">There''s no real focus on this piece, find it a bit bland with a lot of unnecessary detail.</td>', 'There''s no real focus on this piece, find it a bit bland with a lot of unnecessary detail.', '2006-05-16 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420320, 331410, 56567, '<td valign="top">There was a moon pic on a previous challenge which shows you how it should be done. Although a superb effort, there''s too much light reflecting and not enough detail. The crop also looks a little off centre and dont need as much top and bottom.</td>', 'There was a moon pic on a previous challenge which shows you how it should be done. Although a superb effort, there''s too much light reflecting and not enough detail. The crop also looks a little off centre and dont need as much top and bottom.', '2006-05-16 11:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420323, 332346, 56567, '<td valign="top">Too blurred, too grey, too uninspiring. Sorry.</td>', 'Too blurred, too grey, too uninspiring. Sorry.', '2006-05-16 11:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420327, 331990, 56567, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice angle and good choice of light. Something about it looks wrong tho - is it too sharp maybe? Looks very harsh in focus almost like you''ve tried to over-sharpen a blurred image. I''m going to rate you on the effort tho.</td>', 'Wow, nice angle and good choice of light. Something about it looks wrong tho - is it too sharp maybe? Looks very harsh in focus almost like you''ve tried to over-sharpen a blurred image. I''m going to rate you on the effort tho.', '2006-05-16 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420332, 332296, 56567, '<td valign="top">Love the firework''s reflection... unneccesary detail to the right though and would have been nice to take the image from a lower viewpoint to minimalise the distance between light and reflection.</td>', 'Love the firework''s reflection... unneccesary detail to the right though and would have been nice to take the image from a lower viewpoint to minimalise the distance between light and reflection.', '2006-05-16 11:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420345, 331407, 56567, '<td valign="top">Hmm... not doing it for me, sorry.</td>', 'Hmm... not doing it for me, sorry.', '2006-05-16 11:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420346, 332170, 56567, '<td valign="top">The building is too dark.</td>', 'The building is too dark.', '2006-05-16 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420349, 329959, 56567, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Love all the different angles and the blue.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Love all the different angles and the blue.', '2006-05-16 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420352, 329505, 56567, '<td valign="top">Too blurred and busy.</td>', 'Too blurred and busy.', '2006-05-16 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420359, 330318, 56567, '<td valign="top">Too much going on. Would have been nice to get closer in to the reflection of the blue light.</td>', 'Too much going on. Would have been nice to get closer in to the reflection of the blue light.', '2006-05-16 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420361, 331192, 56567, '<td valign="top">Could you have left the shutter open for longer?</td>', 'Could you have left the shutter open for longer?', '2006-05-16 11:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420363, 330271, 56567, '<td valign="top">I think the moon looks cute, but i dont think it works with your choice of composition.</td>', 'I think the moon looks cute, but i dont think it works with your choice of composition.', '2006-05-16 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420364, 332366, 56567, '<td valign="top">Wow, that building in the corner would make an excellent photo in it''s own right. Where is it?</td>', 'Wow, that building in the corner would make an excellent photo in it''s own right. Where is it?', '2006-05-16 11:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420365, 331951, 56567, '<td valign="top">Why is this off centre?</td>', 'Why is this off centre?', '2006-05-16 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420367, 331966, 56567, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty hot photo.</td>', 'This is a pretty hot photo.', '2006-05-16 11:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420368, 331580, 56567, '<td valign="top">strange title! This shot almost works, i would have juat used the basketball lines.</td>', 'strange title! This shot almost works, i would have juat used the basketball lines.', '2006-05-16 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420371, 332107, 56567, '<td valign="top">This is all just a little off - a crop of the middle right of the shot would have worked better IMO.</td>', 'This is all just a little off - a crop of the middle right of the shot would have worked better IMO.', '2006-05-16 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420372, 330552, 56567, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I almost like it''s out-of-focussness!</td>', 'Interesting, I almost like it''s out-of-focussness!', '2006-05-16 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420377, 331126, 56567, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like you''ve managed to capture about 8 different times of the day and night! Love the way you''ve change dthe texture of the water to look like glue!</td>', 'Wow, looks like you''ve managed to capture about 8 different times of the day and night! Love the way you''ve change dthe texture of the water to look like glue!', '2006-05-16 11:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420381, 331679, 56567, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot! Is this an extreme crop of a larger image? There seems to be a little too little detail in the bark.</td>', 'This is a good shot! Is this an extreme crop of a larger image? There seems to be a little too little detail in the bark.', '2006-05-16 11:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420382, 331962, 56567, '<td valign="top">Great colour, why the black down the sides of the image tho? I think it distances the viewer from feeling part of the evening atmosphere.</td>', 'Great colour, why the black down the sides of the image tho? I think it distances the viewer from feeling part of the evening atmosphere.', '2006-05-16 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420384, 332309, 56567, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice. I could see it being one of those ''motivation'' posters you always see at the gym. Not sure if that is a good thing - lol!</td>', 'This is quite nice. I could see it being one of those ''motivation'' posters you always see at the gym. Not sure if that is a good thing - lol!', '2006-05-16 11:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420386, 331195, 56567, '<td valign="top">I felt weightless just looking at this! Wow, how''d you get so close!!!</td>', 'I felt weightless just looking at this! Wow, how''d you get so close!!!', '2006-05-16 11:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420387, 331900, 56567, '<td valign="top">The lack of real point of focus on this is it''s weakness.</td>', 'The lack of real point of focus on this is it''s weakness.', '2006-05-16 11:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420389, 330095, 56567, '<td valign="top">Too much sky for me.</td>', 'Too much sky for me.', '2006-05-16 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420393, 332313, 56567, '<td valign="top">Oooh, lots to look at but in a good way. Shame there''s no real variation in light colour... it all kinda merges together.</td>', 'Oooh, lots to look at but in a good way. Shame there''s no real variation in light colour... it all kinda merges together.', '2006-05-16 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420394, 332485, 56567, '<td valign="top">I''ve got a shot just like this!!</td>', 'I''ve got a shot just like this!!', '2006-05-16 11:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420400, 331041, 56567, '<td valign="top">Nice to see life in a picture!! Unfortunately I think this is a little to bland colour-wise.</td>', 'Nice to see life in a picture!! Unfortunately I think this is a little to bland colour-wise.', '2006-05-16 11:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
