(2421359, 332167, 29486, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the execution was just off.  I''m distrated by the bright background next to the car. The street lights and phone pole also take away from the image. I would have tried to have just the car and the sky and then you would have been better off (I think). - 6</td>', 'I like the idea but the execution was just off.  I''m distrated by the bright background next to the car. The street lights and phone pole also take away from the image. I would have tried to have just the car and the sky and then you would have been better off (I think). - 6', '2006-05-16 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421367, 330036, 48545, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I saw this in a tutorial I was doing the other day ;)  Looks even better at night!</td>', 'I''m sure I saw this in a tutorial I was doing the other day ;)  Looks even better at night!', '2006-05-16 17:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421435, 330546, 29486, '<td valign="top">Your title leads me to believe that there is more to the image than I can see. The foreground seems a little too dark for the overpowering brightness in the top. This difference is making it hard to understand what the photo is about. - 4</td>', 'Your title leads me to believe that there is more to the image than I can see. The foreground seems a little too dark for the overpowering brightness in the top. This difference is making it hard to understand what the photo is about. - 4', '2006-05-16 17:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421442, 330306, 29486, '<td valign="top">Just not enough color, power, or whatever you want to call it to make the photo really pop. - 5</td>', 'Just not enough color, power, or whatever you want to call it to make the photo really pop. - 5', '2006-05-16 17:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421461, 330191, 19978, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this image, but am bugged by the inward-leaning of the buildings on the left, and to a lesser extend, the bridge. Though there is a way to fix this in post, unfortunately, it''s not allowed in basic. Sooo, could it be controlled in camera? Possibly, by finding a site where the perspective effect is not as great, or by finding a vantage point further way and shooting with some zoom. Otherwise, it''s a pretty shot of a pretty location. Focus looks like it could be just a tad better.</td>', 'I really want to like this image, but am bugged by the inward-leaning of the buildings on the left, and to a lesser extend, the bridge. Though there is a way to fix this in post, unfortunately, it''s not allowed in basic. Sooo, could it be controlled in camera? Possibly, by finding a site where the perspective effect is not as great, or by finding a vantage point further way and shooting with some zoom. Otherwise, it''s a pretty shot of a pretty location. Focus looks like it could be just a tad better.', '2006-05-16 17:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421494, 332226, 19978, '<td valign="top">Looks like it was handheld in low light, a prescription for soft and out of focus. The shot has potential though. If you know you''re going to be shooting in situations like this, bring a tripod. If you don''t have one and you still see a shot you must have, find something to brace yourself on, the top of a car, a trash can, a light pole, etc.</td>', 'Looks like it was handheld in low light, a prescription for soft and out of focus. The shot has potential though. If you know you''re going to be shooting in situations like this, bring a tripod. If you don''t have one and you still see a shot you must have, find something to brace yourself on, the top of a car, a trash can, a light pole, etc.', '2006-05-16 17:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421509, 330752, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great colors, one of my top choices for this challenge.</td>', 'Great colors, one of my top choices for this challenge.', '2006-05-16 17:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421510, 330960, 15305, '<td valign="top">Love the textures and color. One of my top choices for this challenge.</td>', 'Love the textures and color. One of my top choices for this challenge.', '2006-05-16 17:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421511, 330208, 15305, '<td valign="top">Excelent use of the zoom to create this magnificent effect. One of my top choices for this challenge. Congratulations!</td>', 'Excelent use of the zoom to create this magnificent effect. One of my top choices for this challenge. Congratulations!', '2006-05-16 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421513, 331925, 15305, '<td valign="top">Wow!! The colors and exposure are incredible. One of my top choices for this challenge. Congratulations!!</td>', 'Wow!! The colors and exposure are incredible. One of my top choices for this challenge. Congratulations!!', '2006-05-16 17:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421517, 331093, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great POV, one of my top choices for this challenge. Congratulations!!!</td>', 'Great POV, one of my top choices for this challenge. Congratulations!!!', '2006-05-16 17:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2421522, 332476, 43088, '<td valign="top">This is a hard shot to get. If you use a higher f-stop to increase depth of field, the moon moves during the exposure and is blurry. If the focus is more on the moon, the palms are probably fuzzier, but that was the way I probably would have gone. Often pictures including a clear moon and other sharp focus objects are composite pictures for these reasons.  I think that under the circumstances, you did pretty well. At least there wasn''t a breeze moving the trees!</td>', 'This is a hard shot to get. If you use a higher f-stop to increase depth of field, the moon moves during the exposure and is blurry. If the focus is more on the moon, the palms are probably fuzzier, but that was the way I probably would have gone. Often pictures including a clear moon and other sharp focus objects are composite pictures for these reasons.  I think that under the circumstances, you did pretty well. At least there wasn''t a breeze moving the trees!', '2006-05-16 18:00:46.000000', NULL, 1);
