(2423651, 330739, 48560, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I especially like the stillness I get when looking at the photo. Anyway, congrats on the 6.2 score, it''s good!<br/> <br/>I got the same exact "star" effects on my nightshots using F8 (star in discussion - top-right lamps) and I wonder if using a larger aperture fixes that - havent got the chance to try it out. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Great shot, I especially like the stillness I get when looking at the photo. Anyway, congrats on the 6.2 score, it''s good! I got the same exact "star" effects on my nightshots using F8 (star in discussion - top-right lamps) and I wonder if using a larger aperture fixes that - havent got the chance to try it out.  ', '2006-05-17 05:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
