(2423807, 330948, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Great shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Great shot.', '2006-05-17 06:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423812, 331925, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Great shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Great shot.', '2006-05-17 06:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423814, 330036, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Excellent shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Excellent shot.', '2006-05-17 06:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423819, 330023, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Great shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10 finish! Great shot.', '2006-05-17 06:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423838, 332081, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post--<br/> <br/>But I want to spend some time on yours, too.  I like it.  I like the composition that you chose, I like the towering effect that it has, and I like the exposure on it.  I have been in this position many, many times, and just submitted something that I didn''t like.  I think that we can still learn from these, if not learn more.  Frustrated or not, still spend a little time in post-processing.  This one would have pulled at least another half point with a little straightening and cropping.  Thanks for the offer to pass you up, and I look forward to nest week''s submission.</td>', '--Trading Post-- But I want to spend some time on yours, too.  I like it.  I like the composition that you chose, I like the towering effect that it has, and I like the exposure on it.  I have been in this position many, many times, and just submitted something that I didn''t like.  I think that we can still learn from these, if not learn more.  Frustrated or not, still spend a little time in post-processing.  This one would have pulled at least another half point with a little straightening and cropping.  Thanks for the offer to pass you up, and I look forward to nest week''s submission.', '2006-05-17 06:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423854, 331869, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post--<br/> <br/>HA, I beat you this week by a mere 0.001.  I do like this shot quite a bit, but I''d like to see you shadows a bit deeper and darker.  Upping the shadows would have done wonders for that noisy sky in the background, and would have probably vaulted you well ahead of mine.  Nice work!</td>', '--Trading Post-- HA, I beat you this week by a mere 0.001.  I do like this shot quite a bit, but I''d like to see you shadows a bit deeper and darker.  Upping the shadows would have done wonders for that noisy sky in the background, and would have probably vaulted you well ahead of mine.  Nice work!', '2006-05-17 06:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423900, 330960, 52628, '<td valign="top">Thank you all!  Well I was really hoping for a ribbon but scores were unusally high this time, great challange.  My first score over 7!!  I''m very glad you people liked it. I will probably take part in more challenges from now on since my exams are almost over. Thanks again!!! :D</td>', 'Thank you all!  Well I was really hoping for a ribbon but scores were unusally high this time, great challange.  My first score over 7!!  I''m very glad you people liked it. I will probably take part in more challenges from now on since my exams are almost over. Thanks again!!! :D', '2006-05-17 06:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423916, 330547, 27901, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Kjartan!!! Wonderful that you got the blue!!! Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations Kjartan!!! Wonderful that you got the blue!!! Well done!', '2006-05-17 06:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423922, 330960, 27901, '<td valign="top">Well done 4th place is great and the voting is high! Congratulations!</td>', 'Well done 4th place is great and the voting is high! Congratulations!', '2006-05-17 06:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2423971, 331869, 36065, '<td valign="top"><b>Hey there from the Critique Club </b> <br/> <br/>Alright...how the heck does this keep happening.  I make a Trading Post comment, then I pull yours from the CC.  Well, her goes...<br/> <br/>Camera Work/Technical:  Great focus.  Everything is very crisp and crystal clear.  Nice choice of the high ISO to keep the shutter speed as quick as possible.  That ocean can be tricky, even in calm water.  I also like the depth of field choice here.  Everything that the eye can see appears to be focused.  The background is a little too noisy.  If you shoot in RAW, upping the shadows would help out a lot.  As far as PP, I have no idea.<br/> <br/>Lighting:  Excellent, excellent lighting.  The available lights give this shot a really nice, peaceful feeling.  No area is overexposed and no area is underexposed.<br/> <br/>Composition/Content:  Stupid kids, but you still put together a great composition.  Your leading lines are near flawless here.  Starting with the skiff line, the eyes are pulled into the frame and all around to the various elements.  Your texturing and coloring here is terrific.  My only critique for the composition would be to remove just a little bit off of the top to get rid of that object in the upper right corner.<br/> <br/>My Opinion: Excellent capture!  I really don''t think that this one ended up with the score it deserved.  This is especially cool since it was your first night shoot.  You got a great eye.</td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club   Alright...how the heck does this keep happening.  I make a Trading Post comment, then I pull yours from the CC.  Well, her goes... Camera Work/Technical:  Great focus.  Everything is very crisp and crystal clear.  Nice choice of the high ISO to keep the shutter speed as quick as possible.  That ocean can be tricky, even in calm water.  I also like the depth of field choice here.  Everything that the eye can see appears to be focused.  The background is a little too noisy.  If you shoot in RAW, upping the shadows would help out a lot.  As far as PP, I have no idea. Lighting:  Excellent, excellent lighting.  The available lights give this shot a really nice, peaceful feeling.  No area is overexposed and no area is underexposed. Composition/Content:  Stupid kids, but you still put together a great composition.  Your leading lines are near flawless here.  Starting with the skiff line, the eyes are pulled into the frame and all around to the various elements.  Your texturing and coloring here is terrific.  My only critique for the composition would be to remove just a little bit off of the top to get rid of that object in the upper right corner. My Opinion: Excellent capture!  I really don''t think that this one ended up with the score it deserved.  This is especially cool since it was your first night shoot.  You got a great eye.', '2006-05-17 07:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2424144, 331899, 29490, '<td valign="top">Congrats Maya - this is an excellent photo (obviously!)!!</td>', 'Congrats Maya - this is an excellent photo (obviously!)!!', '2006-05-17 08:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
