(2424381, 332356, 5746, '<td valign="top">Suspicions hit you hard here. People didn''t believe it wasn''t processed within basic editing rules. Very undeserved score. The image is fantastic and well planned. From the description I can see a lot of work went into it.</td>', 'Suspicions hit you hard here. People didn''t believe it wasn''t processed within basic editing rules. Very undeserved score. The image is fantastic and well planned. From the description I can see a lot of work went into it.', '2006-05-17 09:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
