(2424409, 331053, 49652, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Those reflections are perfect.  Congrats on a perfectly respectable 2nd place finish in the MS Tourney!</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Those reflections are perfect.  Congrats on a perfectly respectable 2nd place finish in the MS Tourney!', '2006-05-17 09:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
