(2425377, 329959, 19670, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! The lines are very nice. I wonder if a larger aperture and shorter exposure would have prevented some of the blown out portions.<br/>I''ve visited the Corning Museum before, but it''s been a long time.</td>', 'Nice capture! The lines are very nice. I wonder if a larger aperture and shorter exposure would have prevented some of the blown out portions.I''ve visited the Corning Museum before, but it''s been a long time.', '2006-05-17 13:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
