(2426390, 331126, 45197, '<td valign="top">I have no idea where that green spot came from and the moon was not full that night, it only looks like it because it''s over-exposed.<br/> <br/>Here is my version of it           <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=335776" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45197/thumb/335776.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45197/thumb/335776.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45197/thumb/335776.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Here is another picture I took of the same waterfall during day from a similar but not the same angle. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=335778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45197/thumb/335778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45197/thumb/335778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45197/thumb/335778.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-17 15:35:44.</i></td>', 'I have no idea where that green spot came from and the moon was not full that night, it only looks like it because it''s over-exposed. Here is my version of it             Here is another picture I took of the same waterfall during day from a similar but not the same angle. ', '2006-05-17 16:35:02.000000', '2006-05-17 16:35:44.000000', 0),
(2426454, 331723, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from CTP2</b> <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I couldn''t finish voting in the night challenge so I didn''t get to yours. :( Had I did I don''t see how I could have scored this anything less than a 7. What stands out for me is the color tone. It really sets an nice mood as well as the water reflection, which has a painterly look. I really don''t have anything negative to say other than I really like the look you''ve acheived. The score you got doesn''t seem right. My only guess on that is people wanted to see more sharpeness/clarity and a few stars, a moon and a UFO probably wouldn''t have hurt. :P</td>', 'Greetings from CTP2  Unfortunately, I couldn''t finish voting in the night challenge so I didn''t get to yours. :( Had I did I don''t see how I could have scored this anything less than a 7. What stands out for me is the color tone. It really sets an nice mood as well as the water reflection, which has a painterly look. I really don''t have anything negative to say other than I really like the look you''ve acheived. The score you got doesn''t seem right. My only guess on that is people wanted to see more sharpeness/clarity and a few stars, a moon and a UFO probably wouldn''t have hurt. :P', '2006-05-17 16:54:22.000000', NULL, 0),
