(2426688, 332243, 22114, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and votes. Yes, I messed up with the title. Nothing strange about it at all. Hope it didn''t hurt my score too much.<br/> <br/>As for "too much sky", well I had to use that angle since there is a house blocking the view right beneath where I was standing (my terrace). I could have cropped it of course, but I didn''t. ;-)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and votes. Yes, I messed up with the title. Nothing strange about it at all. Hope it didn''t hurt my score too much. As for "too much sky", well I had to use that angle since there is a house blocking the view right beneath where I was standing (my terrace). I could have cropped it of course, but I didn''t. ;-)', '2006-05-17 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
