(2426827, 331869, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  WOW! This is really an eyecatching photograph! The wood colors are excellent and the small craft at the bottom is really popping. I think the angle is fantastic. The only advise I could offer on this would be to crop from the top just a tad to eliminate that small piece of sail? or whatever is hanging there. You would still have all the lines and poles going up without that grabbing your eye.</td>', 'Trading post...  WOW! This is really an eyecatching photograph! The wood colors are excellent and the small craft at the bottom is really popping. I think the angle is fantastic. The only advise I could offer on this would be to crop from the top just a tad to eliminate that small piece of sail? or whatever is hanging there. You would still have all the lines and poles going up without that grabbing your eye.', '2006-05-17 18:43:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426836, 332313, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Nice long exposure. I like the colors and the starbursts on the streetlights. The light trails are excellent too. I dislike the large dark spot on the bottom where it looks like it might be trees or bushes. Maybe a slightly different angle to eliminate that would have put you so much higher.</td>', 'Trading post...   Nice long exposure. I like the colors and the starbursts on the streetlights. The light trails are excellent too. I dislike the large dark spot on the bottom where it looks like it might be trees or bushes. Maybe a slightly different angle to eliminate that would have put you so much higher.', '2006-05-17 18:47:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426861, 332114, 52336, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo... one of the best in the challenge.  Great composition, lighting, and subject.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Awesome photo... one of the best in the challenge.  Great composition, lighting, and subject.  Congratulations!', '2006-05-17 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426867, 332081, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I don''t think 5 more minutes to look at and comment on your photograph is any impostion. I like the lighting and angle. Maybe a small crop on the left hand side to eliminate that small bright spot. That way it would fade to black on that side and you wouldn''t be able to see that small piece of fence.</td>', 'Trading post...  I don''t think 5 more minutes to look at and comment on your photograph is any impostion. I like the lighting and angle. Maybe a small crop on the left hand side to eliminate that small bright spot. That way it would fade to black on that side and you wouldn''t be able to see that small piece of fence.', '2006-05-17 18:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
