(2427228, 332313, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>I gave this an 8, Eric.  I really like night shots like this and will eventually get some of my own.  The vantage point you chose is perfect for this kind of shot - nice balance in the buildings on the skyline, both in height and lighting.  I like the way the road curves and disappears into the trees.  Color and sharpness are good as well.<br/> <br/>(Interesting reading comments after I''ve written mine.  I actually like the dark section in the lower left quite a bit.)</td>', 'Trading Post commentI gave this an 8, Eric.  I really like night shots like this and will eventually get some of my own.  The vantage point you chose is perfect for this kind of shot - nice balance in the buildings on the skyline, both in height and lighting.  I like the way the road curves and disappears into the trees.  Color and sharpness are good as well. (Interesting reading comments after I''ve written mine.  I actually like the dark section in the lower left quite a bit.)', '2006-05-17 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427235, 330827, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>First - congrats on a new personal best score!!  This is a good night shot that tells a story.  I like the inclusion of the dark space in front balanced by the tree leaves along the top.  The only distraction is the shadow or dark section running up the wall from the bench - not sure if it IS a shadow or where the wall has been stained.  Still, the overall impact of this shot is very good.  Well seen, well executed.</td>', 'Trading Post commentFirst - congrats on a new personal best score!!  This is a good night shot that tells a story.  I like the inclusion of the dark space in front balanced by the tree leaves along the top.  The only distraction is the shadow or dark section running up the wall from the bench - not sure if it IS a shadow or where the wall has been stained.  Still, the overall impact of this shot is very good.  Well seen, well executed.', '2006-05-17 20:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427285, 332181, 51125, '<td valign="top">That is one very still fisherman.  This is my favorite of the challenge (I am not a big fan of cityscapes).  The simple lines, subtle horizon line and wonderful color make it.  You may want to check out Michael Kennan''s website.  He is a acclaimed photographer that does amazing night exposures for hours.  Your shot here is evocative of his work.</td>', 'That is one very still fisherman.  This is my favorite of the challenge (I am not a big fan of cityscapes).  The simple lines, subtle horizon line and wonderful color make it.  You may want to check out Michael Kennan''s website.  He is a acclaimed photographer that does amazing night exposures for hours.  Your shot here is evocative of his work.', '2006-05-17 21:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427300, 331869, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>Caution - night photography can be addicting.  I''ve only tried it once, but it''s very seductive.  I''d never have thought this was in Columbus, Ohio, nor would I have thought it a scale replica.  Excellent job in disguising both facts.  I gave this a 7 - really like the tones and the perspective, and the light on the right is both intriguing and creates lovely reflections on that side.  Another excellent score, too!</td>', 'Trading Post commentCaution - night photography can be addicting.  I''ve only tried it once, but it''s very seductive.  I''d never have thought this was in Columbus, Ohio, nor would I have thought it a scale replica.  Excellent job in disguising both facts.  I gave this a 7 - really like the tones and the perspective, and the light on the right is both intriguing and creates lovely reflections on that side.  Another excellent score, too!', '2006-05-17 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427309, 331053, 30982, '<td valign="top">An awesome capture, Sandy.  Gorgeous crisp colors and the reflections are perfect.  Hard to believe it was that calm in Texas!  Great score, great finish!</td>', 'An awesome capture, Sandy.  Gorgeous crisp colors and the reflections are perfect.  Hard to believe it was that calm in Texas!  Great score, great finish!', '2006-05-17 21:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427336, 330827, 37858, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the kind comments.  The dark line on the stone wall is the shadow of the lamp post (note that the post is lit on the front side and casts its own shadow to the background).  As I understand the rules for this shot, dodge and burn is not allowed, so I couldn''t figure out a way to get rid of the shadow without lightening the whole photo too much.</td>', 'Thanks for the kind comments.  The dark line on the stone wall is the shadow of the lamp post (note that the post is lit on the front side and casts its own shadow to the background).  As I understand the rules for this shot, dodge and burn is not allowed, so I couldn''t figure out a way to get rid of the shadow without lightening the whole photo too much.', '2006-05-17 21:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427368, 331899, 37893, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this wonderful skyline image ;) Like I said, I love the colors ;)</td>', 'Congrats on this wonderful skyline image ;) Like I said, I love the colors ;)', '2006-05-17 21:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
