(2427587, 331723, 38496, '<td valign="top">from CTP2:<br/> <br/>I like this shot a lot.  The colors are nice ( or sort of lack of color, really).  Cityscapes are always pretty at night (although I always sort of cringe at how much electricty is being sucked up).<br/>It could be a tad sharper.  I''m wondering what it might have looked like with more of the water.  I really like the reflctions that are going on there, where as the black sky is sort of blank.<br/>Overall a great picture.</td>', 'from CTP2: I like this shot a lot.  The colors are nice ( or sort of lack of color, really).  Cityscapes are always pretty at night (although I always sort of cringe at how much electricty is being sucked up).It could be a tad sharper.  I''m wondering what it might have looked like with more of the water.  I really like the reflctions that are going on there, where as the black sky is sort of blank.Overall a great picture.', '2006-05-17 22:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2427750, 332430, 30982, '<td valign="top">I rather like the juxtaposition of the moon and the colored (only in Florida!) building lights.</td>', 'I rather like the juxtaposition of the moon and the colored (only in Florida!) building lights.', '2006-05-17 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 0),
