(2428936, 332081, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this photo.  I would have cropped the left side out of the picture to get rid of the competing slice of brickwork and to reposition the tower off-center to take advantage of the rule of thirds.  The focus is clear, the colors good.  I gave it a 5 during voting (joining the vast number of people who did likewise).</td>', 'I like the lighting in this photo.  I would have cropped the left side out of the picture to get rid of the competing slice of brickwork and to reposition the tower off-center to take advantage of the rule of thirds.  The focus is clear, the colors good.  I gave it a 5 during voting (joining the vast number of people who did likewise).', '2006-05-18 05:52:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2428941, 331869, 37858, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot a lot.  The noise in the sky was a little distracting, but other than that, I liked the colors, lighting, focus, and subject matter.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I liked this shot a lot.  The noise in the sky was a little distracting, but other than that, I liked the colors, lighting, focus, and subject matter.  I gave it an 8.', '2006-05-18 05:55:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2428964, 332313, 37858, '<td valign="top">I thought this picture was done well.  I like the range of tones from white lights to pitch black sky and left foreground.  I like the inclusion of the foreground because it balances the skyline and helps add depth to the photo.  The leading lines of the road way draw my eye into the heart of the picture.  The star-burst street lights are an added plus.</td>', 'I thought this picture was done well.  I like the range of tones from white lights to pitch black sky and left foreground.  I like the inclusion of the foreground because it balances the skyline and helps add depth to the photo.  The leading lines of the road way draw my eye into the heart of the picture.  The star-burst street lights are an added plus.', '2006-05-18 06:05:37.000000', NULL, 0),
