(2429067, 332081, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[tradingpost]]<br/> <br/>I like the lighting but there are a few things that could be fixed, I know this is basic editing so I''ll keep to those boundaries...<br/> <br/>I think the tower is leaning too much, rotating the picture to get it straight is allowed.<br/>the light behind the tower should be cropped out, it does nothing but distract.<br/>and I find the tower to be too centered in the image, but by cropping the light behind the building away I think the tower will be much better positioned in the image.<br/> <br/></td>', '[[tradingpost]] I like the lighting but there are a few things that could be fixed, I know this is basic editing so I''ll keep to those boundaries... I think the tower is leaning too much, rotating the picture to get it straight is allowed.the light behind the tower should be cropped out, it does nothing but distract.and I find the tower to be too centered in the image, but by cropping the light behind the building away I think the tower will be much better positioned in the image. ', '2006-05-18 07:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
