(2620985, 332490, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I just read over some of the comments and I have to disagree with quite a few.  I like the light, and I like it blown.  I like the motion of the hand caused by the slow shutter speed.  Composition works very well, and I rather think the softness/lack of sharp focus lends itself nicely to this picture and its tone.</td>', 'Interesting - I just read over some of the comments and I have to disagree with quite a few.  I like the light, and I like it blown.  I like the motion of the hand caused by the slow shutter speed.  Composition works very well, and I rather think the softness/lack of sharp focus lends itself nicely to this picture and its tone.', '2006-07-14 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
