(3021399, 330297, 53316, '<td valign="top">AWESOME shot. I love kinetic photography and have a few shots posted myself.  This is great because of the sense of motion created by the angles of the lines - while there are a multitude of smaller shapes, they seem to be going in a similar direction.. and that helps give unity and focus to an abstract image.<br/> <br/>edit: Your title''s pretty cool too!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-11 01:17:01.</i></td>', 'AWESOME shot. I love kinetic photography and have a few shots posted myself.  This is great because of the sense of motion created by the angles of the lines - while there are a multitude of smaller shapes, they seem to be going in a similar direction.. and that helps give unity and focus to an abstract image. edit: Your title''s pretty cool too!', '2006-11-11 01:15:23.000000', '2006-11-11 01:17:01.000000', 0),
